 built on top of Upstash REST API."},"features":{"zh":["支持 HTTP/REST API","简单的搜索和更新功能","TypeScript SDK","基于 Upstash REST API","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["HTTP/REST API をサポート","シンプルな検索および更新機能","TypeScript SDK","Upstash REST API を基盤とする","使用と統合が簡単"],"ko":["HTTP/REST API 지원","단순한 검색 및 업데이트 기능","TypeScript SDK","Upstash REST API 기반","사용과 통합이 쉽습니다"],"es":["Instalación sencilla mediante npm","Creación de un cliente de búsqueda y realización de operaciones de upsert y búsqueda","Compatibilidad con la API de REST de Upstash","Soporte para TypeScript","Búsqueda avanzada con capacidades de AI"],"fr":["Installation simple via npm","Création d''un client de recherche et exécution d''opérations d''upsert et de recherche","Compatibilité avec l''API de REST d''Upstash","Prise en charge de TypeScript","Recherche avancée avec des capacités d''IA"],"de":["Einfache Installation über npm","Erstellung eines Suchclients und Durchführung von Upsert- und Suchvorgängen","Kompatibilität mit der Upstash-REST-API","Unterstützung für TypeScript","Erweiterte Suche mit künstlicher Intelligenz"],"pt":["Integração com a API Upstash REST","Suporte a upsert e busca de documentos","Criação de índices personalizados","Suporte a consultas de busca avançadas","Integração com o TypeScript"],"ru":["Интеграция с API Upstash REST","Поддержка upsert и поиска документов","Создание пользовательских индексов","Поддержка продвинутых запросов поиска","Интеграция с TypeScript"],"ar":["التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Upstash REST","دعم upsert و بحث المستندات","إنشاء فهرس مخصص","دعم استفسارات البحث المتقدمة","التكامل مع TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Upstash 搜索","TypeScript SDK","AI 搜索","HTTP/REST API","搜索客户端","Upstash REST API","软件开发工具包"],"ja":["Upstash 検索","TypeScript SDK","AI 検索","HTTP/REST API","検索クライアント","Upstash REST API","ソフトウェア開発キット"],"ko":["Upstash 검색","TypeScript SDK","AI 검색","HTTP/REST API","검색 클라이언트","Upstash REST API","소프트웨어 개발 키트"],"es":["SDK de búsqueda Upstash","TypeScript","búsqueda AI","HTTP/REST","Upstash","desarrollo de aplicaciones","búsqueda avanzada","künstliche Intelligenz"],"fr":["SDK de recherche Upstash","TypeScript","recherche AI","HTTP/REST","Upstash","développement d''applications","recherche avancée","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Upstash-Such-SDK","TypeScript","künstliche Intelligenz-Suche","HTTP/REST","Upstash","Anwendungsentwicklung","erweiterte Suche","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["Upstash Search TypeScript SDK","Biblioteca de busca em AI","Desenvolvimento de software","Integração com API","Busca avançada","TypeScript","Upstash REST API"],"ru":["Upstash Search TypeScript SDK","Библиотека поиска в AI","Разработка программного обеспечения","Интеграция с API","Продвинутый поиск","TypeScript","Upstash REST API"],"ar":["مكتبة Upstash Search TypeScript SDK","مكتبة بحث الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","بحث متقدم","TypeScript","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Upstash REST"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"search-js","repoPath":"upstash/search-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T13:13:22.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash/search TypeScript SDK","description":"Entry point for documentation skills covering Upstash Search quick starts, core concepts, and TypeScript SDK usage. Use when a user asks how to get started, how indexing works, or how to use the TS client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Search Documentation\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the TS SDK:\n\n```\nnpm install @upstash/search\n```\n\nCreate a client and perform a simple upsert + search:\n\n```\nimport { Search } from \"@upstash/search\";\n\nconst client = new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN });\nconst index = client.index(\"my-index\");\n\nawait index.upsert({ id: \"1\", content: { text: \"hello world\" } });\nconst results = await index.search({ query: \"hello\" });\n```\n\nBasi","body":"# Upstash Search Documentation\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the TS SDK:\n\n```\nnpm install @upstash/search\n```\n\nCreate a client and perform a simple upsert + search:\n\n```\nimport { Search } from \"@upstash/search\";\n\nconst client = new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN });\nconst index = client.index(\"my-index\");\n\nawait index.upsert({ id: \"1\", content: { text: \"hello world\" } });\nconst results = await index.search({ query: \"hello\" });\n```\n\nBasic steps:\n- Create an index\n- Insert or update documents\n- Run searches or filtered queries\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\n### sdk-overview\nProvides detailed documentation for all TypeScript SDK commands. Includes:\n- delete: Deleting documents\n- fetch: Retrieving a document\n- info: Index info\n- range: Range queries\n- reset: Clearing an index\n- search: Search queries\n- upsert: Adding/updating documents\n- getting-started: Setup steps for the SDK\n\n### quick-start\nProvides a fast, end-to-end workflow for creating a Search database, adding documents, and querying them. Covers essential concepts including:\n- Creating a database and storing credentials\n- Adding documents with content and metadata\n- Understanding content vs metadata (searchability and filterability)\n- Performing searches with optional reranking\n- Filtering syntax with SQL-like or structured filters\n- Common pitfalls and best practices\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:27:09.607Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced search capabilities via HTTP/REST API integration.","zh":"适用于需要通过 HTTP/REST API 集成高级搜索功能的 AI 代理。","ja":"HTTP/REST API 統合を介して高度な検索機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"HTTP/REST API 통합을 통해 고급 검색 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda avanzadas a través de la integración de la API HTTP/REST.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de recherche avancées via l''intégration de l''API HTTP/REST.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Suchfunktionen über die HTTP/REST-API-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa avançadas via integração de API HTTP/REST.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы расширенные возможности поиска через интеграцию с API HTTP/REST.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات بحث متقدمة عبر دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات HTTP/REST."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform upsert and search operations using the Upstash REST API, enabling efficient data indexing and querying with features like token-based authentication and REST URL configuration.","zh":"赋予代理执行 upsert 和搜索操作的能力，使用 Upstash REST API，使数据索引和查询效率提高，并具有基于令牌的身份验证和 REST URL 配置等功能。","ja":"Upstash REST API を使用して、アップサートおよび検索操作を実行するエージェントを可能にし、トークンベースの認証や REST URL 構成などの機能を備え、効率的なデータ索引とクエリを実現します。","ko":"Upstash REST API를 사용하여 upsert 및 검색 작업을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 토큰 기반 인증 및 REST URL 구성 등의 기능을 제공하여 효율적인 데이터 색인 및 쿼리를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones de upsert y búsqueda utilizando la API REST de Upstash, lo que permite un indexado y consulta de datos eficientes con características como autenticación basada en tokens y configuración de URL de REST.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations d''upsert et de recherche en utilisant l''API REST Upstash, ce qui permet un indexage et une interrogation de données efficaces avec des fonctionnalités comme l''authentification basée sur les jetons et la configuration de l''URL REST.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Upsert- und Suchvorgänge mit der Upstash-REST-API durchzuführen, was ein effizientes Datenindexing und -abfragen mit Funktionen wie Token-basierte Authentifizierung und REST-URL-Konfiguration ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações de upsert e pesquisa usando a API REST do Upstash, permitindo indexação de dados eficiente e consulta com recursos como autenticação baseada em token e configuração de URL REST.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять операции upsert и поиска с использованием API REST Upstash, обеспечивая эффективную индексацию данных и запрос с функциями, такими как аутентификация на основе токенов и настройка URL REST.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أداء عمليات upsert وعمليات بحث باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Upstash REST، وتمكين الفهرسة والاستعلام الفعال للبيانات مع ميزات مثل المصادقة القائمة على رمز البريد وتهيئة عنوان URL REST."},"useCases":{"en":["Upserting data into custom indexes","Performing searches with query parameters","Integrating search functionality into larger applications"],"zh":["将数据 upsert 到自定义索引中","使用查询参数执行搜索","将搜索功能集成到更大的应用程序中"],"ja":["カスタムインデックスにデータを upsert する","クエリパラメータを使用して検索を実行する","検索機能をより大きなアプリケーションに統合する"],"ko":["데이터를 사용자 정의 색인에 upsert 하는 것","쿼리 매개 변수를 사용하여 검색을 수행하는 것","검색 기능을 더 큰 애플리케이션에 통합하는 것"],"es":["Insertar datos en índices personalizados","Realizar búsquedas con parámetros de consulta","Integrar la funcionalidad de búsqueda en aplicaciones más grandes"],"fr":["Insérer des données dans des indexes personnalisés","Effectuer des recherches avec des paramètres de requête","Intégrer la fonctionnalité de recherche dans des applications plus grandes"],"de":["Daten in benutzerdefinierte Indizes einfügen","Suchen mit Abfrageparametern durchführen","Suchfunktion in größere Anwendungen integrieren"],"pt":["Inserção de dados em índices personalizados","Realização de pesquisas com parâmetros de consulta","Integração da funcionalidade de pesquisa em aplicativos maiores"],"ru":["Добавление данных в пользовательские индексы","Выполнение поисков с параметрами запроса","Интеграция функциональности поиска в более крупные приложения"],"ar":["إضافة البيانات إلى الفهارس المخصصة","إجراء عمليات البحث مع معلمات الاستعلام","دمج وظيفة البحث في تطبيقات أكبر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Upstash Search REST URL and token","Dependent on Upstash Search API availability","TypeScript environment required"],"zh":["需要 Upstash Search REST URL 和令牌","依赖于 Upstash Search API 的可用性","需要 TypeScript 环境"],"ja":["Upstash Search REST URL とトークンが必要","Upstash Search API の可用性に依存","TypeScript 環境が必要"],"ko":["Upstash Search REST URL 및 토큰이 필요함","Upstash Search API의 가용성에 의존","TypeScript 환경이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la URL de búsqueda de Upstash y token","Depende de la disponibilidad de la API de búsqueda de Upstash","Entorno de TypeScript requerido"],"fr":["Nécessite l''URL de recherche Upstash et le jeton","Dépend de la disponibilité de l''API de recherche Upstash","Environnement TypeScript requis"],"de":["Benötigt die Upstash-Such-URL und Token","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit der Upstash-Such-API ab","TypeScript-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer URL de pesquisa do Upstash e token","Dependente da disponibilidade da API de pesquisa do Upstash","Ambiente TypeScript necessário"],"ru":["Требуется URL поиска Upstash и токен","Зависит от доступности API поиска Upstash","Требуется среда TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان URL للبحث Upstash والرمز","يعتمد على توافر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للبحث Upstash","بيئة TypeScript مطلوبة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1fd050b2685a320e952461564f1ccbb8008db11ecfc0d2c9f264550e376f4a69","qualityScore":28}');
