r unju-vm","Basierend auf einem Fork von everything-claude-code","KI-Tool für die Verbesserung von Projekten","Einfach zu verwenden und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","Criação de aplicações web inovadoras","Integração com unju-vm","Fork de everything-claude-code","Desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário personalizadas"],"ru":["Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Создание инновационных веб-приложений","Интеграция с unju-vm","Форк everything-claude-code","Разработка индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","إنشاء تطبيقات ويب مبتكرة","التكامل مع unju-vm","فورك everything-claude-code","تطوير واجهات مستخدم مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","前端解决方案","Unju VM","Web应用场景","如何使用frontend-slides","frontend-slides教程","AI智能代理工具","前端开发框架","Unju VM安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","フロントエンドソリューション","Unju VM","Webアプリシナリオ","frontend-slidesの使い方","frontend-slidesチュートリアル","AIエージェントツール","フロントエンド開発フレームワーク","Unju VMのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 솔루션","Unju VM","Web 애플리케이션 시나리오","frontend-slides 사용법","frontend-slides 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 도구","프론트엔드 개발 프레임워크","Unju VM 설치"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","cómo utilizar frontend-slides","qué es un agente de AI","frontend-slides vs otros agentes de AI","instalación de frontend-slides","guía de configuración de frontend-slides","desarrollo de proyectos con frontend-slides","mejora de proyectos con herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''AI pour les développeurs","comment utiliser frontend-slides","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''AI","frontend-slides vs d''autres agents d''AI","installation de frontend-slides","guide de configuration de frontend-slides","développement de projets avec frontend-slides","amélioration de projets avec des outils d''AI"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man frontend-slides verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","frontend-slides vs andere KI-Agents","Installation von frontend-slides","Konfigurationsanleitung für frontend-slides","Projektentwicklung mit frontend-slides","Verbesserung von Projekten mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","como usar frontend-slides","o que é frontend-slides","frontend-slides vs outras ferramentas","instalar frontend-slides","guia de configuração do frontend-slides"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","как использовать frontend-slides","что такое frontend-slides","frontend-slides vs другие инструменты","установить frontend-slides","руководство по настройке frontend-slides"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام frontend-slides","ما هي frontend-slides","frontend-slides مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت frontend-slides","دليل إعداد frontend-slides"]}},"owner":"unju-ai","repo":"ecc","repoPath":"unju-ai/ecc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T05:22:38Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-slides","description":"Create stunning, animation-rich HTML presentations from scratch or by converting PowerPoint files. Use when the user wants to build a presentation, convert a PPT/PPTX to web, or create slides for a talk/pitch. Helps non-designers discover their aesthetic through visual exploration rather than abstract choices.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Slides\n\nCreate zero-dependency, animation-rich HTML presentations that run entirely in the browser.\n\nInspired by the visual exploration approach showcased in work by [zarazhangrui](https://github.com/zarazhangrui).\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Creating a talk deck, pitch deck, workshop deck, or internal presentation\n- Converting `.ppt` or `.pptx` slides into an HTML presentation\n- Improving an existing HTML presentation''s layout, motion, or typography\n- Exploring presentation styles with a","body":"# Frontend Slides\n\nCreate zero-dependency, animation-rich HTML presentations that run entirely in the browser.\n\nInspired by the visual exploration approach showcased in work by [zarazhangrui](https://github.com/zarazhangrui).\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Creating a talk deck, pitch deck, workshop deck, or internal presentation\n- Converting `.ppt` or `.pptx` slides into an HTML presentation\n- Improving an existing HTML presentation''s layout, motion, or typography\n- Exploring presentation styles with a user who does not know their design preference yet\n\n## Non-Negotiables\n\n1. **Zero dependencies**: default to one self-contained HTML file with inline CSS and JS.\n2. **Viewport fit is mandatory**: every slide must fit inside one viewport with no internal scrolling.\n3. **Show, don''t tell**: use visual previews instead of abstract style questionnaires.\n4. **Distinctive design**: avoid generic purple-gradient, Inter-on-white, template-looking decks.\n5. **Production quality**: keep code commented, accessible, responsive, and performant.\n\nBefore generating, read `STYLE_PRESETS.md` for the viewport-safe CSS base, density limits, preset catalog, and CSS gotchas.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Detect Mode\n\nChoose one path:\n- **New presentation**: user has a topic, notes, or full draft\n- **PPT conversion**: user has `.ppt` or `.pptx`\n- **Enhancement**: user already has HTML slides and wants improvements\n\n### 2. Discover Content\n\nAsk only the minimum needed:\n- purpose: pitch, teaching, conference talk, internal update\n- length: short (5-10), medium (10-20), long (20+)\n- content state: finished copy, rough notes, topic only\n\nIf the user has content, ask them to paste it before styling.\n\n### 3. Discover Style\n\nDefault to visual exploration.\n\nIf the user already knows the desired preset, skip previews and use it directly.\n\nOtherwise:\n1. Ask what feeling the deck should create: impressed, energized, focused, inspired.\n2. Generate **3 single-slide preview files** in `.ecc-design/slide-previews/`.\n3. Each preview must be self-contained, show typography/color/motion clearly, and stay under roughly 100 lines of slide content.\n4. Ask the user which preview to keep or what elements to mix.\n\nUse the preset guide in `STYLE_PRESETS.md` when mapping mood to style.\n\n### 4. Build the Presentation\n\nOutput either:\n- `presentation.html`\n- `[presentation-name].html`\n\nUse an `assets/` folder only when the deck contains extracted or user-supplied images.\n\nRequired structure:\n- semantic slide sections\n- a viewport-safe CSS base from `STYLE_PRESETS.md`\n- CSS custom properties for theme values\n- a presentation controller class for keyboard, wheel, and touch navigation\n- Intersection Observer for reveal animations\n- reduced-motion support\n\n### 5. Enforce Viewport Fit\n\nTreat this as a hard gate.\n\nRules:\n- every `.slide` must use `height: 100vh; height: 100dvh; overflow: hidden;`\n- all type and spacing must scale with `clamp()`\n- when content does not fit, split into multiple slides\n- never solve overflow by shrinking text below readable sizes\n- never allow scrollbars inside a slide\n\nUse the density limits and mandatory CSS block in `STYLE_PRESETS.md`.\n\n### 6. Validate\n\nCheck the finished deck at these sizes:\n- 1920x1080\n- 1280x720\n- 768x1024\n- 375x667\n- 667x375\n\nIf browser automation is available, use it to verify no slide overflows and that keyboard navigation works.\n\n### 7. Deliver\n\nAt handoff:\n- delete temporary preview files unless the user wants to keep them\n- open the deck with the platform-appropriate opener when useful\n- summarize file path, preset used, slide count, and easy theme customization points\n\nUse the correct opener for the current OS:\n- macOS: `open file.html`\n- Linux: `xdg-open file.html`\n- Windows: `start \"\" file.html`\n\n## PPT / PPTX Conversion\n\nFor PowerPoint conversion:\n1. Prefer `python3` with `python-pptx` to extract text, images, and notes.\n2. If `python-pptx` is unavailable, ask whether to install it or fall back to a manual/export-based workflow.\n3. Preserve slide order, speaker notes, and extracted assets.\n4. After extraction, run the same style-selection workflow as a new presentation.\n\nKeep conversion cross-platform. Do not rely on macOS-only tools when Python can do the job.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n### HTML / CSS\n\n- Use inline CSS and JS unless the user explicitly wants a multi-file project.\n- Fonts may come from Google Fonts or Fontshare.\n- Prefer atmospheric backgrounds, strong type hierarchy, and a clear visual direction.\n- Use abstract shapes, gradients, grids, noise, and geometry rather than illustrations.\n\n### JavaScript\n\nInclude:\n- keyboard navigation\n- touch / swipe navigation\n- mouse wheel navigation\n- progress indicator or slide index\n- reveal-on-enter animation triggers\n\n### Accessibility\n\n- use semantic structure (`main`, `section`, `nav`)\n- keep contrast readable\n- support keyboard-only navigation\n- respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n\n## Content Density Limits\n\nUse these maxima unless the user explicitly asks for denser slides and readability still holds:\n\n| Slide type | Limit |\n|------------|-------|\n| Title | 1 heading + 1 subtitle + optional tagline |\n| Content | 1 heading + 4-6 bullets or 2 short paragraphs |\n| Feature grid | 6 cards max |\n| Code | 8-10 lines max |\n| Quote | 1 quote + attribution |\n| Image | 1 image constrained by viewport |\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- generic startup gradients with no visual identity\n- system-font decks unless intentionally editorial\n- long bullet walls\n- code blocks that need scrolling\n- fixed-height content boxes that break on short screens\n- invalid negated CSS functions like `-clamp(...)`\n\n## Related ECC Skills\n\n- `frontend-patterns` for component and interaction patterns around the deck\n- `liquid-glass-design` when a presentation intentionally borrows Apple glass aesthetics\n- `e2e-testing` if you need automated browser verification for the final deck\n\n## Deliverable Checklist\n\n- presentation runs from a local file in a browser\n- every slide fits the viewport without scrolling\n- style is distinctive and intentional\n- animation is meaningful, not noisy\n- reduced motion is respected\n- file paths and customization points are explained at handoff\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T04:10:13.800Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to create interactive, animation-rich HTML presentations with zero dependencies.","zh":"非常适合需要创建交互式、动画丰富的HTML演示文稿且无依赖的AI代理。","ja":"依存関係がない状態でインタラクティブでアニメーション豊かなHTMLプレゼンテーションを作成する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"의존성 없이 대화형 및 애니메이션 풍부한 HTML 발표 자료를 생성해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan crear presentaciones interactivas y ricas en animación en HTML con cero dependencias.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de créer des présentations interactives et riches en animation en HTML avec zéro dépendances.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die interaktive, animationsreiche HTML-Präsentationen mit null Abhängigkeiten erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam criar apresentações interativas e ricas em animação em HTML com zero dependências.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо создавать интерактивные, анимационно-насыщенные HTML-презентации без каких-либо зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء عروض تقديمية تفاعلية وغنية بالرسوم المتحركة في HTML بدون أي ارتباطات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate engaging HTML presentations that run entirely in the browser, utilizing animation-rich techniques and supporting conversion from .ppt or .pptx formats, all while maintaining a focus on layout, motion, and typography.","zh":"赋予代理生成吸引人的HTML演示文稿的能力，这些演示文稿可以完全在浏览器中运行，利用动画丰富的技术，并支持从.ppt或.pptx格式转换，同时保持布局、动作和排版的关注。","ja":"エージェントがブラウザ内で完全に実行される魅力的でインタラクティブなHTMLプレゼンテーションを生成できるようにし、アニメーション豊かな技術を利用し、.pptまたは.pptx形式からの変換をサポートし、レイアウト、動き、タイポグラフィに焦点を当てています。","ko":"에이전트가 브라우저에서 완전히 실행되며 애니메이션豊かな 기술을 활용하여 .ppt 또는 .pptx 형식에서 변환을 지원하고 레이아웃, 동작 및 타이포그래피에 중점을 둔 대화형 HTML 프레젠테이션을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar presentaciones HTML atractivas que se ejecutan completamente en el navegador, utilizando técnicas ricas en animación y compatibilidad con la conversión desde formatos .ppt o .pptx, manteniendo al mismo tiempo un enfoque en el diseño, el movimiento y la tipografía.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des présentations HTML engageantes qui s''exécutent entièrement dans le navigateur, en utilisant des techniques riches en animation et en prenant en charge la conversion à partir des formats .ppt ou .pptx, tout en maintenant un focus sur la mise en page, le mouvement et la typographie.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, ansprechende HTML-Präsentationen zu erstellen, die vollständig im Browser ausgeführt werden, indem animationsreiche Techniken verwendet und die Konvertierung aus .ppt- oder .pptx-Formaten unterstützt wird, während gleichzeitig der Fokus auf Layout, Bewegung und Typografie liegt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar apresentações HTML atraentes que são executadas completamente no navegador, utilizando técnicas ricas em animação e com suporte à conversão de formatos .ppt ou .pptx, tudo isso mantendo o foco no layout, movimento e tipografia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать привлекательные HTML-презентации, которые выполняются полностью в браузере, используя анимационно-насыщенные техники и поддерживая преобразование из форматов .ppt или .pptx, все это при сохранении внимания к макету, движению и типографике.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء عروض تقديمية HTML جذابة تعمل بالكامل في المتصفح، باستخدام تقنيات غنية بالرسوم المتحركة ودعم التحويل من صيغ .ppt أو .pptx، مع الحفاظ على التركيز على التصميم والحركة والطباعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating interactive talk decks with dynamic content","Converting existing .pptx slides to HTML presentations","Enhancing existing HTML presentations with advanced motion and typography"],"zh":["创建具有动态内容的交互式演讲稿","将现有的.pptx幻灯片转换为HTML演示文稿","使用高级动作和排版增强现有的HTML演示文稿"],"ja":["動的コンテンツを備えたインタラクティブなトークデッキの作成","既存の.pptxスライドをHTMLプレゼンテーションに変換","高度な動きとタイポグラフィを使用して既存のHTMLプレゼンテーションを強化"],"ko":["동적 콘텐츠가 포함된 대화형 토크 덱 생성","기존 .pptx 슬라이드를 HTML 프레젠테이션으로 변환","고급 movimiento 및 타이포그래피를 사용하여 기존 HTML 프레젠테이션 강화"],"es":["Creación de decks de charla interactivos con contenido dinámico","Conversión de diapositivas .pptx existentes en presentaciones HTML","Mejora de presentaciones HTML existentes con movimiento y tipografía avanzados"],"fr":["Création de decks de présentation interactifs avec contenu dynamique","Conversion de diapositives .pptx existantes en présentations HTML","Amélioration de présentations HTML existantes avec mouvement et typographie avancés"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Vortragsdecks mit dynamischem Inhalt","Konvertierung bestehender .pptx-Folien in HTML-Präsentationen","Verbesserung bestehender HTML-Präsentationen mit fortschrittlichem Bewegungs- und Typografie-Design"],"pt":["Criar decks de conversa interativos com conteúdo dinâmico","Converter slides .pptx existentes em apresentações HTML","Melhorar apresentações HTML existentes com movimento avançado e tipografia"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных докладов с динамическим контентом","Преобразование существующих слайдов .pptx в HTML-презентации","Улучшение существующих HTML-презентаций с помощью продвинутого движения и типографики"],"ar":["إنشاء عروض تقديمية تفاعلية مع محتوى ديناميكي","تحويل شرائح .pptx الحالية إلى عروض تقديمية HTML","تحسين عروض تقديمية HTML الحالية مع حركة متقدمة وطباعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires browser compatibility","Limited to HTML presentation format"],"zh":["需要浏览器兼容性","仅限HTML演示文稿格式"],"ja":["ブラウザの互換性が必要","HTMLプレゼンテーション形式のみ"],"ko":["브라우저 호환성이 필요함","HTML 프레젠테이션 형식만"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el navegador","Limitado al formato de presentación HTML"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité du navigateur","Limité au format de présentation HTML"],"de":["Benötigt Browser-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf HTML-Präsentationsformat"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade do navegador","Limitado ao formato de apresentação HTML"],"ru":["Требует совместимости браузера","Ограничен форматом HTML-презентации"],"ar":["يتطلب توافق المتصفح","محدود بصيغة عرض HTML"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"da378954096f51844ab9214d6ae30f317d7f5373af41fbc7e989d20518adb9b8","qualityScore":27}');
