경고를 해결하는 기술 집합입니다","es":"El guía de depuración de Vue 3 es una colección de mejores prácticas para identificar y solucionar errores en aplicaciones Vue 3","fr":"Le guide de débogage Vue 3 est une collection de bonnes pratiques pour identifier et résoudre les erreurs dans les applications Vue 3","de":"Der Vue 3-Debugging-Leitfaden ist eine Sammlung von Best Practices, um Fehler in Vue 3-Anwendungen zu identifizieren und zu beheben","pt":"O que é depuração Vue 3? É o processo de identificar e solucionar problemas em aplicações Vue 3","ru":"Что такое отладка Vue 3? Это процесс выявления и решения проблем в приложениях Vue 3","ar":"ما هو التصحيح الفني لفيو 3؟ هو عملية تحديد و حل المشاكل في تطبيقات فيو 3"},"features":{"en":["Tracing unexpected re-renders and state updates using reactivity-debugging-hooks","Handling async operations overwriting with stale data via watch-async-cleanup","Creating watchers inside async callbacks with watch","Resolving hydration bugs for seamless application performance","Utilizing pinia for state management and tailwindcss for styling","Leveraging vite for optimized development and build processes"],"zh":["Reactivity 调试","Watchers 调试","异步操作数据覆盖问题解决","创建 Watchers 内部异步回调问题解决","hydration bugs 解决"],"ja":["Reactivity デバッグ","Watchers デバッグ","非同期操作データ上書き問題の解決","Watchers 内の非同期コールバック問題の解決","hydration bugs 解決"],"ko":["Reactivity 디버깅","Watchers 디버깅","비동기 작업 데이터 덮어쓰기 문제 해결","Watchers 내 비동기 콜백 문제 해결","hydration bugs 해결"],"es":["Depuración de reactividad y actualizaciones de estado","Solución de errores de hidratación y warnings en tiempo de ejecución","Uso de watchers para detectar errores asíncronos","Implementación de hooks de depuración de reactividad","Limpieza de datos asíncronos en watchers","Creación de watchers dentro de callbacks asíncronos"],"fr":["Débogage de la réactivité et des mises à jour d''état","Résolution des erreurs d''hydratation et des warnings en temps de execution","Utilisation de watchers pour détecter les erreurs asíncronos","Implementation de hooks de débogage de réactivité","Nettoyage des données asíncronos dans les watchers","Création de watchers à l''intérieur des callbacks asíncronos"],"de":["Debugging von Reaktivität und Zustandsaktualisierungen","Behebung von Hydratationsfehlern und Laufzeitwarnungen","Verwendung von Watchern zur Erkennung von asynchronen Fehlern","Implementierung von Reaktivitäts-Debugging-Hooks","Bereinigung von asynchronen Daten in Watchern","Erstellung von Watchern innerhalb von asynchronen Callbacks"],"pt":["Depuração de reatividade para identificar atualizações de estado inesperadas","Técnicas para solucionar problemas de watchers","Dicas para evitar sobreposição de dados assíncronos","Melhores práticas para criar watchers dentro de callbacks assíncronos","Técnicas de depuração para hydration bugs","Ferramentas para tracing de re-renders inesperados"],"ru":["Отладка реактивности для выявления непредвиденных обновлений состояния","Техники для решения проблем с watchers","Советы для избежания перезаписи асинхронных данных","Лучшие практики для создания watchers внутри асинхронных callbacks","Техники отладки для hydration bugs","Инструменты для трассировки непредвиденных повторных рендеров"],"ar":["تصحيح التفاعل لتحديد تحديثات الحالة غير المتوقعة","تقنيات لحل مشاكل المشاهدة","نصائح لتجنب الكتابة فوق البيانات المتسلسلة","أفضل الممارسات لإنشاء مشاهد داخل الإيقافات المتسلسلة","تقنيات التصحيح لعيوب الترطيب","أدوات لتسلسل إعادة التحديث غير المتوقعة"]},"keywords":{"en":["vue-debug-guides tutorial","vue 3 debugging best practices","vue-debug-guides vs chrome devtools","how to install vue-debug-guides","vue-debug-guides setup guide","vue-debug-guides alternative tools","vue-debug-guides for uniapp development","vue-debug-guides and pinia integration","vue-debug-guides error handling"],"zh":["Vue 3 调试","Vue 3 错误处理","Reactivity 调试","Watchers 调试","Vue 3 性能优化","AI エージェント","Vue 3 开发指南"],"ja":["Vue 3 デバッグ","Vue 3 エラーハンドリング","Reactivity デバッグ","Watchers デバッグ","Vue 3 パフォーマンス最適化","AI エージェント","Vue 3 開発ガイド"],"ko":["Vue 3 디버깅","Vue 3 에러 핸들링","Reactivity 디버깅","Watchers 디버깅","Vue 3 성능 최적화","AI 에이전트","Vue 3 개발 가이드"],"es":["depuración de Vue 3","errores de hidratación","warnings en tiempo de ejecución","reactividad en Vue 3","watchers en Vue 3","debugging de Vue 3","mejores prácticas de Vue 3","solución de errores en Vue 3","desarrollo de aplicaciones Vue 3"],"fr":["débogage de Vue 3","erreurs d''hydratation","warnings en temps de execution","réactivité dans Vue 3","watchers dans Vue 3","debugging de Vue 3","bonnes pratiques de Vue 3","résolution des erreurs dans Vue 3","développement d''applications Vue 3"],"de":["Debugging von Vue 3","Hydratationsfehler","Laufzeitwarnungen","Reaktivität in Vue 3","Watcher in Vue 3","Debugging von Vue 3","Best Practices für Vue 3","Fehlerbehebung in Vue 3","Entwicklung von Vue 3-Anwendungen"],"pt":["depuração vue 3","reactividade vue","watchers vue","desenvolvimento vue 3","melhores práticas vue","solução de problemas vue","vue 3 debugging","vue reactivity","vue watchers"],"ru":["отладка vue 3","реактивность vue","watchers vue","разработка vue 3","лучшие практики vue","решение проблем vue","vue 3 отладка","vue реактивность","vue watchers"],"ar":["تصحيح فيو 3","تفاعل فيو","مشاهدة فيو","تطوير فيو 3","أفضل الممارسات فيو","حل المشاكل فيو","فيو 3 تصحيح","فيو التفاعل","فيو المشاهدة"]}},"owner":"zuiaizengdada","repo":"uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template","repoPath":"zuiaizengdada/uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template","stars":9,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-02T04:25:14Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-debug-guides","description":"Vue 3 debugging and error handling for runtime errors, warnings, async failures, and SSR/hydration issues. Use when diagnosing or fixing Vue issues.","bodyPreview":"Vue 3 debugging and error handling for runtime issues, warnings, async failures, and hydration bugs.\nFor development best practices and common gotchas, use `vue-best-practices`.\n\n### Reactivity\n\n- Tracing unexpected re-renders and state updates → See [reactivity-debugging-hooks](reference/reactivity-debugging-hooks.md)\n\n### Watchers\n\n- Async operations overwriting with stale data → See [watch-async-cleanup](reference/watch-async-cleanup.md)\n- Creating watchers inside async callbacks → See [watch","body":"Vue 3 debugging and error handling for runtime issues, warnings, async failures, and hydration bugs.\nFor development best practices and common gotchas, use `vue-best-practices`.\n\n### Reactivity\n\n- Tracing unexpected re-renders and state updates → See [reactivity-debugging-hooks](reference/reactivity-debugging-hooks.md)\n\n### Watchers\n\n- Async operations overwriting with stale data → See [watch-async-cleanup](reference/watch-async-cleanup.md)\n- Creating watchers inside async callbacks → See [watch-async-creation-memory-leak](reference/watch-async-creation-memory-leak.md)\n\n### Components\n\n- Child component throws \"component not found\" error → See [local-components-not-in-descendants](reference/local-components-not-in-descendants.md)\n- Click listener doesn''t fire on custom component → See [click-events-on-components](reference/click-events-on-components.md)\n- Parent can''t access child ref data in script setup → See [component-ref-requires-defineexpose](reference/component-ref-requires-defineexpose.md)\n- HTML template parsing breaks Vue component syntax → See [in-dom-template-parsing-caveats](reference/in-dom-template-parsing-caveats.md)\n- Wrong component renders due to naming collisions → See [component-naming-conflicts](reference/component-naming-conflicts.md)\n- Parent styles don''t apply to multi-root component → See [multi-root-component-class-attrs](reference/multi-root-component-class-attrs.md)\n\n### Props & Emits\n\n- Variables referenced in defineProps cause errors → See [prop-defineprops-scope-limitation](reference/prop-defineprops-scope-limitation.md)\n- Component emits undeclared event causing warnings → See [declare-emits-for-documentation](reference/declare-emits-for-documentation.md)\n- defineEmits used inside function or conditional → See [defineEmits-must-be-top-level](reference/defineEmits-must-be-top-level.md)\n- defineEmits has both type and runtime arguments → See [defineEmits-no-runtime-and-type-mixed](reference/defineEmits-no-runtime-and-type-mixed.md)\n- Native event listeners not responding to clicks → See [native-event-collision-with-emits](reference/native-event-collision-with-emits.md)\n- Component event fires twice when clicking → See [undeclared-emits-double-firing](reference/undeclared-emits-double-firing.md)\n\n### Templates\n\n- Getting template compilation errors with statements → See [template-expressions-restrictions](reference/template-expressions-restrictions.md)\n- \"Cannot read property of undefined\" runtime errors → See [v-if-null-check-order](reference/v-if-null-check-order.md)\n- Dynamic directive arguments not working properly → See [dynamic-argument-constraints](reference/dynamic-argument-constraints.md)\n- v-else elements rendering unconditionally always → See [v-else-must-follow-v-if](reference/v-else-must-follow-v-if.md)\n- Child components in loops showing undefined data → See [v-for-component-props](reference/v-for-component-props.md)\n- Array order changing after sorting or reversing → See [v-for-computed-reverse-sort](reference/v-for-computed-reverse-sort.md)\n- List items disappearing or swapping state unexpectedly → See [v-for-key-attribute](reference/v-for-key-attribute.md)\n- Getting off-by-one errors with range iteration → See [v-for-range-starts-at-one](reference/v-for-range-starts-at-one.md)\n- v-show or v-else not working on template elements → See [v-show-template-limitation](reference/v-show-template-limitation.md)\n\n### Template Refs\n\n- Ref becomes null when element is conditionally hidden → See [template-ref-null-with-v-if](reference/template-ref-null-with-v-if.md)\n- Ref array indices don''t match data array in loops → See [template-ref-v-for-order](reference/template-ref-v-for-order.md)\n- Refactoring template ref names breaks silently in code → See [use-template-ref-vue35](reference/use-template-ref-vue35.md)\n\n### Forms & v-model\n\n- Initial form values not showing when using v-model → See [v-model-ignores-html-attributes](reference/v-model-ignores-html-attributes.md)\n- Textarea content changes not updating the ref → See [textarea-no-interpolation](reference/textarea-no-interpolation.md)\n- iOS users cannot select dropdown first option → See [select-initial-value-ios-bug](reference/select-initial-value-ios-bug.md)\n- Parent and child components have different values → See [define-model-default-value-sync](reference/define-model-default-value-sync.md)\n- Object property changes not syncing to parent → See [definemodel-object-mutation-no-emit](reference/definemodel-object-mutation-no-emit.md)\n- Real-time search/validation broken for Chinese/Japanese input → See [v-model-ime-composition](reference/v-model-ime-composition.md)\n- Number input returns empty string instead of zero → See [v-model-number-modifier-behavior](reference/v-model-number-modifier-behavior.md)\n- Custom checkbox values not submitted in forms → See [checkbox-true-false-value-form-submission](reference/checkbox-true-false-value-form-submission.md)\n\n### Events & Modifiers\n\n- Chaining multiple event modifiers produces unexpected results → See [event-modifier-order-matters](reference/event-modifier-order-matters.md)\n- Keyboard shortcuts don''t fire with system modifier keys → See [keyup-modifier-timing](reference/keyup-modifier-timing.md)\n\n### Lifecycle\n\n- Memory leaks from unremoved event listeners → See [cleanup-side-effects](reference/cleanup-side-effects.md)\n- DOM access fails before component mounts → See [lifecycle-dom-access-timing](reference/lifecycle-dom-access-timing.md)\n- DOM reads return stale values after state changes → See [dom-update-timing-nexttick](reference/dom-update-timing-nexttick.md)\n- SSR rendering differs from client hydration → See [lifecycle-ssr-awareness](reference/lifecycle-ssr-awareness.md)\n\n### Slots\n\n- Wrapper components breaking child slot functionality → See [slot-forwarding-to-child-components](reference/slot-forwarding-to-child-components.md)\n\n### Provide/Inject\n\n- Calling provide after async operations fails silently → See [provide-inject-synchronous-setup](reference/provide-inject-synchronous-setup.md)\n- Tracing where provided values come from → See [provide-inject-debugging-challenges](reference/provide-inject-debugging-challenges.md)\n- Injected values not updating when provider changes → See [provide-inject-reactivity-not-automatic](reference/provide-inject-reactivity-not-automatic.md)\n- Multiple components share same default object → See [provide-inject-default-value-factory](reference/provide-inject-default-value-factory.md)\n\n### Attrs\n\n- Both internal and fallthrough event handlers execute → See [attrs-event-listener-merging](reference/attrs-event-listener-merging.md)\n- Explicit attributes overwritten by fallthrough values → See [fallthrough-attrs-overwrite-vue3](reference/fallthrough-attrs-overwrite-vue3.md)\n- Attributes applying to wrong element in wrappers → See [inheritattrs-false-for-wrapper-components](reference/inheritattrs-false-for-wrapper-components.md)\n\n### Composables\n\n- Composable called outside setup context or asynchronously → See [composable-call-location-restrictions](reference/composable-call-location-restrictions.md)\n- Composable reactive dependency not updating when input changes → See [composable-tovalue-inside-watcheffect](reference/composable-tovalue-inside-watcheffect.md)\n\n### Composition API\n\n- Lifecycle hooks failing silently after async operations → See [composition-api-script-setup-async-context](reference/composition-api-script-setup-async-context.md)\n- Parent component refs unable to access exposed properties → See [define-expose-before-await](reference/define-expose-before-await.md)\n\n### Async Components\n\n- Network failures or timeouts loading components → See [async-component-error-handling](reference/async-component-error-handling.md)\n- Template refs undefined after component reactivation → See [async-component-keepalive-ref-issue](reference/async-component-keepalive-ref-issue.md)\n\n### Teleport\n\n- Teleport target element not found in DOM → See [teleport-target-must-exist](reference/teleport-target-must-exist.md)\n- Teleported content breaks SSR hydration → See [teleport-ssr-hydration](reference/teleport-ssr-hydration.md)\n\n### Suspense\n\n- Need to handle async errors from Suspense components → See [suspense-no-builtin-error-handling](reference/suspense-no-builtin-error-handling.md)\n- Using Suspense with server-side rendering → See [suspense-ssr-hydration-issues](reference/suspense-ssr-hydration-issues.md)\n\n### SSR\n\n- HTML differs between server and client renders → See [ssr-hydration-mismatch-causes](reference/ssr-hydration-mismatch-causes.md)\n\n### SFC (Single File Components)\n\n- Trying to use named exports from component script blocks → See [sfc-named-exports-forbidden](reference/sfc-named-exports-forbidden.md)\n- Variables not updating in template after changes → See [sfc-script-setup-reactivity](reference/sfc-script-setup-reactivity.md)\n\n### Plugins\n\n- Debugging why global properties cause naming conflicts → See [plugin-global-properties-sparingly](reference/plugin-global-properties-sparingly.md)\n- Plugin not working or inject returns undefined → See [plugin-install-before-mount](reference/plugin-install-before-mount.md)\n\n### App Configuration\n\n- App configuration methods not working after mount call → See [configure-app-before-mount](reference/configure-app-before-mount.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:48:44.842Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents working with Vue 3 applications, needing advanced debugging and error handling capabilities for runtime issues, warnings, and async failures.","zh":"非常适合使用 Vue 3 应用程序的前端代理，需要高级调试和错误处理功能来解决运行时问题、警告和异步失败。","ja":"Vue 3 アプリケーションを使用するフロントエンド エージェントに最適で、ランタイムの問題、警告、および非同期のエラーに対する高度なデバッグおよびエラー処理機能が必要です。","ko":"Vue 3 애플리케이션을 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 런타임 문제, 경고 및 비동기 실패에 대한 고급 디버깅 및 오류 처리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que trabajan con aplicaciones Vue 3, que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de depuración y manejo de errores para problemas de tiempo de ejecución, advertencias y fallos asíncronos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend travaillant avec des applications Vue 3, ayant besoin de capacités avancées de débogage et de gestion des erreurs pour les problèmes d''exécution, les avertissements et les défaillances asynchrones.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die mit Vue 3-Anwendungen arbeiten und erweiterte Debugging- und Fehlerbehandlungsfunktionen für Laufzeitprobleme, Warnungen und asynchrone Fehler benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que trabalham com aplicações Vue 3, necessitando de capacidades avançadas de depuração e tratamento de erros para problemas de tempo de execução, avisos e falhas assíncronas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, работающих с приложениями Vue 3, которые требуют расширенных возможностей отладки и обработки ошибок для проблем, возникающих во время выполнения, предупреждений и асинхронных сбоев.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يعملون مع تطبيقات Vue 3، والذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصحيح الأخطاء ومعالجة الأخطاء لمشاكل وقت التشغيل والتحذيرات والفشل غير المتزامن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug and resolve Vue 3 runtime issues, warnings, and async failures, leveraging tools like reactivity-debugging-hooks and watch-async-cleanup, while also handling hydration bugs and integrating with popular libraries like uniapp, vite, pinia, and tailwindcss.","zh":"赋予代理调试和解决 Vue 3 运行时问题、警告和异步失败的能力，利用诸如 reactivity-debugging-hooks 和 watch-async-cleanup 的工具，同时也处理水合 bug 并集成流行的库，如 uniapp、vite、pinia 和 tailwindcss。","ja":"エージェントに Vue 3 のランタイムの問題、警告、および非同期のエラーをデバッグして解決する能力を与え、reactivity-debugging-hooks や watch-async-cleanup などのツールを利用し、同時に水化バグを処理し、uniapp、vite、pinia、tailwindcss などの人気ライブラリと統合します。","ko":"에이전트에게 Vue 3 런타임 문제, 경고 및 비동기 오류를 디버깅하고 해결할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, reactivity-debugging-hooks 및 watch-async-cleanup와 같은 도구를 활용同时에 수분 버그를 처리하고 uniapp, vite, pinia 및 tailwindcss와 같은 인기 라이브러리와 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar y resolver problemas de tiempo de ejecución de Vue 3, advertencias y fallos asíncronos, aprovechando herramientas como reactivity-debugging-hooks y watch-async-cleanup, y también manejar errores de hidratación e integrarse con bibliotecas populares como uniapp, vite, pinia y tailwindcss.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer et de résoudre les problèmes d''exécution de Vue 3, les avertissements et les défaillances asynchrones, en exploitant des outils tels que reactivity-debugging-hooks et watch-async-cleanup, tout en gérant les bogues d''hydratation et en s''intégrant avec des bibliothèques populaires comme uniapp, vite, pinia et tailwindcss.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Laufzeitprobleme von Vue 3, Warnungen und asynchrone Fehler zu debuggen und zu beheben, indem es Tools wie reactivity-debugging-hooks und watch-async-cleanup nutzt und auch Hydratationsfehler handhabt und sich mit beliebten Bibliotheken wie uniapp, vite, pinia und tailwindcss integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar e resolver problemas de tempo de execução do Vue 3, avisos e falhas assíncronas, utilizando ferramentas como reactivity-debugging-hooks e watch-async-cleanup, além de lidar com bugs de hidratação e integrar com bibliotecas populares como uniapp, vite, pinia e tailwindcss.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отлаживать и решать проблемы, возникающие во время выполнения Vue 3, предупреждения и асинхронные сбои, используя инструменты, такие как reactivity-debugging-hooks и watch-async-cleanup, а также обрабатывать ошибки гидратации и интегрироваться с популярными библиотеками, такими как uniapp, vite, pinia и tailwindcss.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصحيح الأخطاء ومعالجة مشاكل وقت التشغيل في Vue 3 والتحذيرات والفشل غير المتزامن، باستخدام أدوات مثل reactivity-debugging-hooks و watch-async-cleanup، بالإضافة إلى معالجة أخطاء التهيئة والتكامل مع مكتبات شائعة مثل uniapp و vite و pinia و tailwindcss."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging unexpected re-renders and state updates in Vue 3 applications","Resolving async operations overwriting with stale data in watchers","Identifying and fixing hydration bugs in Vue 3 applications","Optimizing watcher creation inside async callbacks for better performance"],"zh":["调试 Vue 3 应用程序中的意外重新渲染和状态更新","解决异步操作覆盖 watcher 中的过时数据的问题","识别和修复 Vue 3 应用程序中的水合 bug","优化异步回调内的 watcher 创建以提高性能"],"ja":["Vue 3 アプリケーションにおける予期せぬ再描画と状態の更新をデバッグする","ウォッチャーで古いデータで上書きされる非同期操作を解決する","Vue 3 アプリケーションにおける水化バグを識別して修正する","非同期コールバック内のウォッチャーの作成を最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Vue 3 애플리케이션에서 예기치 못한 재렌더링 및 상태 업데이트를 디버깅하는 것","ウォッチャー에서 오래된 데이터로 덮어써지는 비동기 작업을 해결하는 것","Vue 3 애플리케이션에서 수분 버그를 식별하고 수정하는 것","비동기 콜백 내의 워처 생성을 최적화하여 성능을 개선하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de renderizaciones y actualizaciones de estado inesperadas en aplicaciones Vue 3","Resolución de operaciones asíncronas que sobrescriben con datos obsoletos en watchers","Identificación y corrección de errores de hidratación en aplicaciones Vue 3","Optimización de la creación de watchers dentro de callbacks asíncronos para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Débogage des réaffichages et des mises à jour d''état inattendus dans les applications Vue 3","Résolution des opérations asynchrones qui écrasent les données obsolètes dans les watchers","Identification et correction des bogues d''hydratation dans les applications Vue 3","Optimisation de la création de watchers à l''intérieur des callbacks asynchrones pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Debugging unerwarteter Neurenderungen und Statusaktualisierungen in Vue 3-Anwendungen","Behebung asynchroner Operationen, die mit veralteten Daten in Watchern überschrieben werden","Identifizierung und Behebung von Hydratationsfehlern in Vue 3-Anwendungen","Optimierung der Watcher-Erstellung innerhalb asynchroner Callbacks für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Depuração de re-renderizações inesperadas e atualizações de estado em aplicações Vue 3","Resolução de operações assíncronas que sobrescrevem dados obsoletos em watchers","Identificação e correção de bugs de hidratação em aplicações Vue 3","Otimização da criação de watchers dentro de callbacks assíncronos para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Отладка непредвиденных повторных рендеров и обновлений состояния в приложениях Vue 3","Решение асинхронных операций, перезаписывающих устаревшие данные в watchers","Определение и исправление ошибок гидратации в приложениях Vue 3","Оптимизация создания watchers внутри асинхронных callback-функций для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء في إعادة عرض غير متوقعة وتحديثات الحالة في تطبيقات Vue 3","معالجة العمليات غير المتزامنة التي تحذف البيانات القديمة في المشاهدين","تحديد ومعالجة أخطاء التهيئة في تطبيقات Vue 3","تحسين إنشاء المشاهدين داخل الدوال غير المتزامنة لتحقيق أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Vue 3 applications","Requires knowledge of Vue 3 debugging and error handling best practices","Intended for use with uniapp, vite, pinia, and tailwindcss libraries"],"zh":["特定于 Vue 3 应用程序","需要了解 Vue 3 调试和错误处理的最佳实践","仅适用于 uniapp、vite、pinia 和 tailwindcss 库"],"ja":["Vue 3 アプリケーションに特有のもの","Vue 3 のデバッグとエラー処理のベストプラクティスについての知識が必要","uniapp、vite、pinia、tailwindcss ライブラリのみを使用する場合に使用する"],"ko":["Vue 3 애플리케이션에만 해당","Vue 3 디버깅 및 오류 처리에 대한 모범 사례를 이해해야 함","uniapp, vite, pinia 및 tailwindcss 라이브러리와 함께 사용할 때만 사용"],"es":["Específico para aplicaciones Vue 3","Requiere conocimiento de las mejores prácticas de depuración y manejo de errores de Vue 3","Diseñado para su uso con bibliotecas como uniapp, vite, pinia y tailwindcss"],"fr":["Spécifique aux applications Vue 3","Nécessite une connaissance des meilleures pratiques de débogage et de gestion des erreurs de Vue 3","Conçu pour être utilisé avec des bibliothèques telles que uniapp, vite, pinia et tailwindcss"],"de":["Spezifisch für Vue 3-Anwendungen","Benötigt Kenntnisse der besten Praktiken für Debugging und Fehlerbehandlung in Vue 3","Für den Einsatz mit Bibliotheken wie uniapp, vite, pinia und tailwindcss vorgesehen"],"pt":["Específico para aplicações Vue 3","Exige conhecimento das melhores práticas de depuração e tratamento de erros do Vue 3","Destinado a ser usado com bibliotecas uniapp, vite, pinia e tailwindcss"],"ru":["Специфичен для приложений Vue 3","Требует знания лучших практик отладки и обработки ошибок Vue 3","Предназначен для использования с библиотеками uniapp, vite, pinia и tailwindcss"],"ar":["محدد لتطبيقات Vue 3","يتطلب معرفة أفضل الممارسات لتصحيح الأخطاء ومعالجة الأخطاء في Vue 3","مصمم للاستخدام مع مكتبات uniapp و vite و pinia و tailwindcss"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"cd4695540dac2fbc16352cbb12f975246b6ac5870e8b82943cbd8bb54edc51ed","qualityScore":26}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'zuiaizengdada/uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template/vue-debug-guides';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('zuiaizengdada/uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template/vue-debug-guides', 'vue-debug-guides', 'zuiaizengdada', 'uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template', 'community', 'vue-debug-guides zuiaizengdada uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template community vue-debug-guides provides a comprehensive debugging solution for Vue 3 applications, helping developers identify and resolve runtime issues, warnings, and async failures. Ideal for developers working with uniapp, vite, pinia, and tailwindcss. 此项目提供 Vue 3 调试和错误处理的指南，包括 Reactivity 和 Watchers 的调试 このプロジェクトでは、Vue 3 のデバッグとエラーハンドリングのガイドを提供します 이 프로젝트에서는 Vue 3 디버깅 및 에러 핸들링에 대한 가이드를 제공합니다 Esta guía de depuración de Vue 3 proporciona consejos y trucos para solucionar errores y warnings en tiempo de ejecución, incluyendo reactividad y watchers Ce guide de débogage Vue 3 fournit des conseils et des astuces pour résoudre les erreurs et les warnings en temps de execution, incluant la réactivité et les watchers Dieser Vue 3-Debugging-Leitfaden bietet Tipps und Tricks, um Laufzeitfehler und Warnungen zu beheben, einschließlich Reaktivität und Watchern O guia de depuração Vue 3 fornece dicas e técnicas para solucionar problemas em aplicações Vue 3, incluindo reatividade e watchers. Руководство по отладке Vue 3 предоставляет советы и техники для решения проблем в приложениях Vue 3, включая реактивность и watchers. يدل دليل التصحيح الفني لفيو 3 على نصائح و تقنيات لحل المشاكل في تطبيقات فيو 3، بما في ذلك التفاعل و المشاهدة. vue-debug-guides tutorial vue 3 debugging best practices vue-debug-guides vs chrome devtools how to install vue-debug-guides vue-debug-guides setup guide vue-debug-guides alternative tools vue-debug-guides for uniapp development vue-debug-guides and pinia integration vue-debug-guides error handling Vue 3 调试 Vue 3 错误处理 Reactivity 调试 Watchers 调试 Vue 3 性能优化 AI エージェント Vue 3 开发指南 Tracing unexpected re-renders and state updates using reactivity-debugging-hooks Handling async operations overwriting with stale data via watch-async-cleanup Creating watchers inside async callbacks with watch Resolving hydration bugs for seamless application performance Utilizing pinia for state management and tailwindcss for styling Leveraging vite for optimized development and build processes vue-debug-guides is a debugging toolkit for Vue 3 applications, offering guidance on reactivity, watchers, and error handling for efficient development.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('o1xhack/telegram-watch/telegram-watch-dev', 'community', 'o1xhack', 'telegram-watch', 'o1xhack/telegram-watch', 'telegram-watch-dev', 7, 0, 26, '2026-02-13T08:45:30Z', '2026-03-06T06:50:21.750Z', '25b838c2495257daa4f55e0974b32aacd795fa4de5cdbd0c64142ede56a9db6f', '{"id":"o1xhack/telegram-watch/telegram-watch-dev","name":"telegram-watch-dev","description":{"en":"The telegram-watch-dev skill is a fully local Telegram watcher that monitors specific users and captures messages into SQLite. It benefits developers who need to track Telegram activity.","zh":"Telegram_WATCH_DEV是一个监控Telegram用户和群组的工具，使用Telethon和SQLite","ja":"TelegramWatchDevは、TelethonとSQLiteを使用してTelegramユーザーとグループを監視するツールです","ko":"Telegram_WATCH_DEV는 Telethon과 SQLite를 사용하여 Telegram 사용자와 그룹을 모니터링하는 도구입니다","es":"Telegram-watch-dev es una herramienta de monitoreo de Telegram que utiliza Telethon y SQLite para capturar mensajes y medios de usuarios y canales específicos.","fr":"Telegram-watch-dev est un outil de surveillance Telegram qui utilise Telethon et SQLite pour capturer des messages et des médias d''utilisateurs et de canaux spécifiques.","de":"Telegram-watch-dev ist ein Überwachungstool für Telegram, das Telethon und SQLite verwendet, um Nachrichten und Medien von bestimmten Nutzern und Kanälen zu erfassen.","pt":"O telegram-watch-dev é uma ferramenta de monitoramento de Telegram que usa Telethon para capturar mensagens e mídia de usuários e canais específicos e gerar relatórios em HTML","ru":"telegram-watch-dev — это инструмент для мониторинга Telegram, который использует Telethon для захвата сообщений и медиа конкретных пользователей и каналов и генерации отчетов в HTML","ar":"telegram-watch-dev هو أداة مراقبة تليجرام تستخدم Telethon لالتقاط الرسائل والوسائط من المستخدمين والقنوات المحددة وتوليد تقارير بالصيغة HTML"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"telegram-watch-dev: Setup Guide for AI Agents | AI Agent ...","zh":"Telegram_WATCH_DEV_SETUP_GUIDE","ja":"TelegramWatchDev AIエージェントの設定方法","ko":"Telegram_WATCH_DEV_설치_가이드","es":"Guía de configuración de telegram-watch-dev para desarrol...","fr":"Guide d''installation de telegram-watch-dev pour les dével...","de":"Einrichtungsanleitung für telegram-watch-dev-Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Configuração do telegram-watch-dev: Monitoramento...","ru":"Настройка telegram-watch-dev: Мониторинг Telegram с помощ...","ar":"دليل إعداد telegram-watch-dev: مراقبة تليجرام باستخدام Te..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how to monitor Telegram groups and channels with telegram-watch-dev. Learn to capture messages and media into SQLite and generate periodic HTML repo...","zh":"使用Telethon监控特定Telegram用户和群组，并将消息和媒体捕获到SQLite数据库中","ja":"Telethonを使用して特定のTelegramユーザーとグループを監視し、メッセージとメディアをSQLiteデータベースにキャプチャする","ko":"Telethon을 사용하여 특정 Telegram 사용자와 그룹을 모니터링하고 메시지 및 미디어를 SQLite 데이터베이스에 캡처","es":"Descubre cómo configurar telegram-watch-dev para monitorear usuarios y canales de Telegram con Telethon y SQLite","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer telegram-watch-dev pour surveiller les utilisateurs et les canaux Telegram avec Telethon et SQLite","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie telegram-watch-dev für die Überwachung von Telegram-Nutzern und -Kanälen mit Telethon und SQLite einrichten","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o telegram-watch-dev para monitorar usuários e canais do Telegram, capturar mensagens e mídia e gerar relatórios periódicos em HTML","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить telegram-watch-dev для мониторинга пользователей и каналов Telegram, захвата сообщений и медиа и генерации периодических отчетов в HTML","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد telegram-watch-dev لمراقبة المستخدمين والقنوات على تليجرام، وحفظ الرسائل والوسائط وتوليد تقارير دورية بالصيغة HTML"},"definition":{"en":"telegram-watch-dev is a Telethon-powered watcher that monitors Telegram groups and channels, capturing messages and media into SQLite.","zh":"Telegram_WATCH_DEV是一个基于Telethon的Telegram监控工具","ja":"TelegramWatchDevは、Telethonを基盤とするTelegram監視ツールです","ko":"Telegram_WATCH_DEV는 Telethon을 기반으로 하는 Telegram 모니터링 도구입니다","es":"¿Qué es telegram-watch-dev? Es una herramienta de monitoreo de Telegram que utiliza Telethon y SQLite para capturar mensajes y medios.","fr":"Qu''est-ce que telegram-watch-dev ? C''est un outil de surveillance Telegram qui utilise Telethon et SQLite pour capturer des messages et des médias.","de":"Was ist telegram-watch-dev? Es ist ein Überwachungstool für Telegram, das Telethon und SQLite verwendet, um Nachrichten und Medien zu erfassen.","pt":"O que é telegram-watch-dev? É uma ferramenta de monitoramento de Telegram que usa Telethon para capturar mensagens e mídia","ru":"Что такое telegram-watch-dev? Это инструмент для мониторинга Telegram, который использует Telethon для захвата сообщений и медиа","ar":"ما هو telegram-watch-dev؟ هو أداة مراقبة تليجرام تستخدم Telethon لالتقاط الرسائل والوسائط"},"features":{"en":["Monitors specific users in target groups/channels using Telethon","Captures messages and media into SQLite database","Generates periodic HTML reports and pushes them to a control chat","Follows a mandatory requirements workflow with approved requests","Utilizes a self-hosted solution for privacy and security"],"zh":["使用Telethon监控特定Telegram用户和群组","将消息和媒体捕获到SQLite数据库中","支持CLI命令行接口","使用Python编写","支持自定义报告和通知","使用SQLite数据库存储数据"],"ja":["Telethonを使用して特定のTelegramユーザーとグループを監視する","メッセージとメディアをSQLiteデータベースにキャプチャする","CLIコマンドラインインターフェースをサポートする","Pythonで書かれている","カスタムレポートと通知をサポートする","SQLiteデータベースを使用してデータを保存する"],"ko":["Telethon을 사용하여 특정 Telegram 사용자와 그룹을 모니터링","메시지와 미디어를 SQLite 데이터베이스에 캡처","CLI 명령어 인터페이스를 지원","Python으로 작성","사용자 지정 보고서와 알림을 지원","SQLite 데이터베이스를 사용하여 데이터를 저장"],"es":["Monitoreo de usuarios y canales de Telegram con Telethon","Captura de mensajes y medios en SQLite","Informes periódicos en HTML","Configuración mediante interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI)","Compatibilidad con Python"],"fr":["Surveillance des utilisateurs et des canaux Telegram avec Telethon","Capture de messages et de médias dans SQLite","Rapports périodiques en HTML","Configuration via l''interface de ligne de commande (CLI)","Compatibilité avec Python"],"de":["Überwachung von Telegram-Nutzern und -Kanälen mit Telethon","Erfassung von Nachrichten und Medien in SQLite","Regelmäßige Berichte in HTML","Konfiguration über die Kommandozeilenoberfläche (CLI)","Kompatibilität mit Python"],"pt":["Monitoramento de usuários e canais do Telegram","Captura de mensagens e mídia com Telethon","Gerência de relatórios periódicos em HTML","Armazenamento de dados em SQLite","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para configuração e controle"],"ru":["Мониторинг пользователей и каналов Telegram","Захват сообщений и медиа с помощью Telethon","Генерация периодических отчетов в HTML","Хранение данных в SQLite","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для настройки и управления"],"ar":["مراقبة المستخدمين والقنوات على تليجرام","التقاط الرسائل والوسائط باستخدام Telethon","توليد تقارير دورية بالصيغة HTML","تخزين البيانات في SQLite","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) للاعداد والتحكم"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use telegram-watch-dev","telegram-watch-dev setup guide","telegram-watch-dev alternative","telegram-watch-dev vs telethon","telegram-watch-dev install","what is telegram-watch-dev","telegram-watch-dev tutorial","telegram-watch-dev documentation","telegram client for monitoring"],"zh":["Telegram监控","Telethon","SQLite","Python","CLI","监控工具","Telegram用户监控","Telegram群组监控","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Telegram監視","Telethon","SQLite","Python","CLI","監視ツール","Telegramユーザー監視","Telegramグループ監視","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Telegram 모니터링","Telethon","SQLite","Python","CLI","모니터링 도구","Telegram 사용자 모니터링","Telegram 그룹 모니터링","AI 에이전트"],"es":["telegram-watch-dev","herramientas de monitoreo de Telegram","Telethon","SQLite","informes periódicos","CLI","Python","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["telegram-watch-dev","outils de surveillance Telegram","Telethon","SQLite","rapports périodiques","CLI","Python","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["telegram-watch-dev","Überwachungstools für Telegram","Telethon","SQLite","regelmäßige Berichte","CLI","Python","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["telegram-watch-dev","monitoramento de telegram","telethon","cli","sqlite","relatórios em html","ferramentas de monitoramento","desenvolvimento de software","programação python"],"ru":["telegram-watch-dev","мониторинг телеграмма","telethon","cli","sqlite","отчеты в html","инструменты мониторинга","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на python"],"ar":["telegram-watch-dev","مراقبة تليجرام","telethon","cli","sqlite","تقارير بالصيغة html","أدوات المراقبة","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة بايثون"]}},"owner":"o1xhack","repo":"telegram-watch","repoPath":"o1xhack/telegram-watch","stars":7,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-13T08:45:30Z","topics":["cli","monitoring","privacy","python","reporting","selfhosted","sqlite","telegram","telegram-client","telethon","watcher"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"telegram-watch-dev","description":"Develop telegram-watch using a requirements-first workflow (Draft -> Approved -> Implementing -> Done) with minimal, testable changes.","bodyPreview":"When using this skill, ALWAYS follow this workflow:\n\n0) Requirements workflow is mandatory (no exceptions)\n- Source of truth: `docs/requests/`\n- Intake: `docs/inbox.md`\n- Template: `docs/templates/REQ_TEMPLATE.md`\n\n1) Before coding: pick work from Approved requests\n- List `docs/requests/` and find requirements with `Status: Approved`.\n- If multiple exist, choose the lowest-numbered / smallest-scope one unless the user specifies an ID.\n\n2) If there is NO Approved request\n- Read `docs/inbox.md` (i","body":"When using this skill, ALWAYS follow this workflow:\n\n0) Requirements workflow is mandatory (no exceptions)\n- Source of truth: `docs/requests/`\n- Intake: `docs/inbox.md`\n- Template: `docs/templates/REQ_TEMPLATE.md`\n\n1) Before coding: pick work from Approved requests\n- List `docs/requests/` and find requirements with `Status: Approved`.\n- If multiple exist, choose the lowest-numbered / smallest-scope one unless the user specifies an ID.\n\n2) If there is NO Approved request\n- Read `docs/inbox.md` (if present) and/or the user’s latest message.\n- Create ONE new Draft requirement file:\n  - Path: `docs/requests/REQ-YYYYMMDD-###-slug.md`\n  - Content: must follow `docs/templates/REQ_TEMPLATE.md`\n  - Set `Status: Draft`\n- STOP after creating the Draft and ask the user to approve it.\n- Do NOT implement anything until the user confirms approval (Status becomes Approved).\n\n3) When starting implementation of an Approved request\n- Update the chosen REQ:\n  - `Status: Approved` -> `Status: Implementing`\n  - Add a short plan in the REQ (2–6 bullets max).\n- Implement the request strictly as written; avoid unrelated refactors.\n\n4) Build order for MVP code work\n- Implement in this order: `doctor` -> `once` -> `run`.\n\n4.1) README localization rule\n- Any time you add or update content in `README.md`, you must apply the same change (or equivalent translation) to every localized README (`README.zh-Hans.md`, `README.zh-Hant.md`, `README.ja.md`). Language switch links at the top must also stay in sync.\n\n5) After each change set, run validations\n- python -m telegram_watch doctor --config config.toml\n- python -m telegram_watch once --config config.toml --since 10m\n\n6) Completion protocol\n- Ensure all Acceptance Criteria in the REQ and `ACCEPTANCE.md` are satisfied.\n- Update the REQ:\n  - Tick the acceptance checkboxes\n  - Add “What changed” (files touched + brief rationale)\n  - `Status: Implementing` -> `Status: Done`\n\n7) Security / open-source hygiene (never violate)\n- Never print or commit secrets (api_hash, phone, session).\n- Ensure `.gitignore` excludes: `config.toml`, `*.session`, `data/`, `reports/`.\n- Keep data local by default; do not add cloud dependencies unless explicitly approved.\n\n8) Commit protocol\n- When the user says “commit”, always include both a summary and a description in the commit message.\n- Use this format:\n  - `git commit -m \"SUMMARY\" -m \"DETAILS\"`\n  - SUMMARY: short, action-oriented, and specific.\n  - DETAILS: 2–6 bullets or sentences describing key changes, ordered by importance.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:50:21.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Monitoring Agents requiring local Telegram activity tracking and SQLite database integration.","zh":"适用于需要本地Telegram活动跟踪和SQLite数据库集成的监控代理。","ja":"ローカルのTelegram活動追跡とSQLiteデータベース統合を必要とする監視エージェントに適しています。","ko":"로컬 Telegram 활동 추적 및 SQLite 데이터베이스 통합이 필요한 모니터링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de monitoreo que requieren seguimiento de actividad de Telegram local y integración con la base de datos SQLite.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de surveillance nécessitant une surveillance de l''activité Telegram locale et une intégration avec la base de données SQLite.","de":"Ideal für Überwachungsagenten, die eine lokale Telegram-Aktivitätsverfolgung und eine SQLite-Datenbankintegration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de monitoramento que exigem rastreamento de atividade local do Telegram e integração com banco de dados SQLite.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мониторинга, требующих отслеживания местной активности Telegram и интеграции с базой данных SQLite.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراقبة تتطلب تتبع نشاط تليجرام محلي وتكامل قاعدة بيانات SQLite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture and store Telegram messages locally using SQLite, enabling advanced Telegram activity monitoring and analysis with protocols like TCP/IP and data formats like SQL queries.","zh":"赋予代理捕获和存储Telegram消息的能力，使用SQLite进行本地存储，实现高级的Telegram活动监控和分析，支持TCP/IP等协议和SQL查询等数据格式。","ja":"エージェントがTelegramメッセージをローカルでキャプチャしてSQLiteに保存できるようにし、TCP/IPなどのプロトコルやSQLクエリーなどのデータ形式で高度なTelegram活動監視と分析を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Telegram 메시지를 로컬에서 캡처하여 SQLite에 저장할 수 있도록 하여 TCP/IP와 같은 프로토콜 및 SQL 쿼리와 같은 데이터 형식으로 고급 Telegram 활동 모니터링 및 분석을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes capturar y almacenar mensajes de Telegram localmente utilizando SQLite, lo que permite una supervisión y análisis avanzados de la actividad de Telegram con protocolos como TCP/IP y formatos de datos como consultas SQL.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer et de stocker localement des messages Telegram en utilisant SQLite, ce qui permet une surveillance et une analyse avancées de l''activité Telegram avec des protocoles comme TCP/IP et des formats de données comme des requêtes SQL.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Telegram-Nachrichten lokal mit SQLite zu erfassen und zu speichern, was eine erweiterte Überwachung und Analyse der Telegram-Aktivität mit Protokollen wie TCP/IP und Datenformaten wie SQL-Abfragen ermöglicht.","pt":"Permite que os agentes capturam e armazenem mensagens do Telegram localmente usando SQLite, permitindo um monitoramento avançado de atividade do Telegram e análise com protocolos como TCP/IP e formatos de dados como consultas SQL.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватывать и хранить сообщения Telegram локально с помощью SQLite, обеспечивая расширенный мониторинг активности Telegram и анализ с использованием протоколов типа TCP/IP и форматов данных, таких как запросы SQL.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التقاط وتخزين رسائل تليجرام محليًا باستخدام SQLite، مما يتيح مراقبة متقدمة لنشاط تليجرام وتحليل باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل TCP/IP وتنسيقات بيانات مثل استعلامات SQL."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring specific Telegram users and capturing messages","Automating Telegram activity tracking with SQLite database storage","Debugging Telegram message capture issues with local logging"],"zh":["监控特定Telegram用户并捕获消息","使用SQLite数据库存储自动化Telegram活动跟踪","使用本地日志调试Telegram消息捕获问题"],"ja":["特定のTelegramユーザーを監視してメッセージをキャプチャする","SQLiteデータベースストレージを使用してTelegram活動追跡を自動化する","ローカルログを使用してTelegramメッセージキャプチャの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["특정 Telegram 사용자를 모니터링하고 메시지를 캡처하는こと","SQLite 데이터베이스 저장소를 사용하여 Telegram 활동 추적을 자동화하는 것","로컬 로깅을 사용하여 Telegram 메시지 캡처 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Seguimiento de usuarios específicos de Telegram y captura de mensajes","Automatización del seguimiento de la actividad de Telegram con almacenamiento de base de datos SQLite","Depuración de problemas de captura de mensajes de Telegram con registro local"],"fr":["Suivi d''utilisateurs spécifiques de Telegram et capture de messages","Automatisation du suivi de l''activité Telegram avec stockage de base de données SQLite","Débogage des problèmes de capture de messages Telegram avec journalisation locale"],"de":["Überwachung bestimmter Telegram-Benutzer und Erfassung von Nachrichten","Automatisierung der Überwachung der Telegram-Aktivität mit SQLite-Datenbank-Speicher","Fehlerbehebung bei der Erfassung von Telegram-Nachrichten mit lokaler Protokollierung"],"pt":["Monitoramento de usuários específicos do Telegram e captura de mensagens","Automação do rastreamento de atividade do Telegram com armazenamento de banco de dados SQLite","Depuração de problemas de captura de mensagens do Telegram com registro local"],"ru":["Мониторинг определенных пользователей Telegram и захват сообщений","Автоматизация отслеживания активности Telegram с хранением базы данных SQLite","Отладка проблем захвата сообщений Telegram с локальным журналированием"],"ar":["مراقبة مستخدمين معينين من تليجرام وتمييز الرسائل","تأتمة تتبع نشاط تليجرام مع تخزين قاعدة بيانات SQLite","تصحيح أخطاء في تقاط رسائل تليجرام مع تسجيل محلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local SQLite database setup","Mandatory requirements workflow with approved requests","Limited to tracking specific users and messages"],"zh":["需要本地SQLite数据库设置","具有批准请求的强制性工作流程","仅限跟踪特定用户和消息"],"ja":["ローカルのSQLiteデータベース設定が必要","承認されたリクエストを伴う必須ワークフロー","特定のユーザーとメッセージのみを追跡する"],"ko":["로컬 SQLite 데이터베이스 설정이 필요","승인된 요청을 포함하는 필수 워크플로","특정 사용자 및 메시지만을 추적하는 것"],"es":["Requiere configuración local de base de datos SQLite","Requisitos de flujo de trabajo obligatorios con solicitudes aprobadas","Limitado al seguimiento de usuarios y mensajes específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de base de données SQLite locale","Exigences de flux de travail obligatoires avec des demandes approuvées","Limité au suivi d''utilisateurs et de messages spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert lokale SQLite-Datenbank-Konfiguration","Obligatorische Workflow-Anforderungen mit genehmigten Anfragen","Begrenzt auf die Überwachung bestimmter Benutzer und Nachrichten"],"pt":["Exige configuração de banco de dados SQLite local","Fluxo de trabalho de requisitos obrigatórios com solicitações aprovadas","Limitado ao rastreamento de usuários e mensagens específicos"],"ru":["Требует настройки локальной базы данных SQLite","Обязательный рабочий процесс требований с одобренными запросами","Ограничен отслеживанием определенных пользователей и сообщений"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد قاعدة بيانات SQLite محلي","تدفق عمل متطلبات إلزامي مع طلبات معتمدة","محدود بتتبع مستخدمين ورسائل معينين"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"25b838c2495257daa4f55e0974b32aacd795fa4de5cdbd0c64142ede56a9db6f","qualityScore":26}');
