INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('qte77/Agents-eval/committing-staged-with-message', 'committing-staged-with-message', 'qte77', 'Agents-eval', 'community', 'committing-staged-with-message qte77 Agents-eval community committing-staged-with-message is a Multi-Agent System evaluation framework that generates and evaluates scientific paper reviews. It benefits developers by automating Git workflows Committing-Staged-With-Message 是一个使用 PydanticAI 的多代理系统评估框架，通过传统指标、LLM-as-a-Judge 和图形复杂性分析等三层评估方法生成和评估科学论文审查 Committing-Staged-With-Message は、PydanticAI を使用したマルチエージェントシステム評価フレームワークで、伝統的な指標、LLM-as-a-Judge、グラフベースの複雑さ分析などの 3 つの評価方法で科学論文のレビューを生成および評価します Committing-Staged-With-Message는 PydanticAI를 사용하는 多代理システム 평가 프레임워크로서 전통적인 지표, LLM-as-a-Judge 및 그래프 기반 복잡도 분석 등의 3단계 평가 방법으로 과학 논문 리뷰를 생성 및 평가합니다 Committing-staged-with-message es un marco de evaluación de sistemas multiagente que utiliza PydanticAI para evaluar cambios de código Committing-staged-with-message est un cadre d''évaluation de systèmes multi-agents qui utilise PydanticAI pour évaluer les modifications de code Committing-staged-with-message ist ein Bewertungsrahmen für Multi-Agenten-Systeme, der PydanticAI zur Bewertung von Code-Änderungen verwendet O committing-staged-with-message é uma ferramenta que utiliza PydanticAI para avaliar artigos científicos committing-staged-with-message - это инструмент, использующий PydanticAI для оценки научных статей committing-staged-with-message هو أداة تستخدم PydanticAI لتقييم الأبحاث العلمية how to use committing-staged-with-message what is committing-staged-with-message committing-staged-with-message alternative committing-staged-with-message vs Git hooks committing-staged-with-message install committing-staged-with-message setup guide PydanticAI Git workflow automation Bash Git workflow scripting automating Git commit messages Committing-Staged-With-Message PydanticAI 多代理系统评估框架 科学论文审查 Git diff Git log AI工具 自动化评估 Analyzes staged changes using `git diff --staged --name-only` and `git diff --staged --stat` Reviews detailed staged changes with `git diff --staged` Implements size guard to skip full diff for large changes Utilizes PydanticAI for evaluation framework Runs Bash commands for context gathering Generates commit messages based on staged changes committing-staged-with-message is a Git workflow automation tool using PydanticAI and Bash to analyze staged changes and generate commit messages');
