ung von Reibungspunkten","Behebung von Problemen","Live-Sitzungen","Konfiguration von Self-Heal","LEITFADEN von Self-Heal","AI-Tools"],"pt":["Self-Heal","IA para desenvolvedores","correção de problemas","sessões ao vivo","habilidades de IA","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias de IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","correção automática"],"ru":["Self-Heal","ИИ для разработчиков","исправление проблем","живые сессии","навыки ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения","технологии ИИ","инструменты разработки","автоматическая коррекция"],"ar":["Self-Heal","الذكاء الاصطناعي للبرمجة","معالجة المشاكل","الجلسات الحية","مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات البرمجة","الإصلاح الآلي"]}},"owner":"odysseyalive","repo":"omarchy-seashells-theme","repoPath":"odysseyalive/omarchy-seashells-theme","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T20:53:42Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"self-heal","description":"Ambient friction detection and surgical skill correction. Embeds into all skills. Triggers at task resolution when skill instructions caused friction.","bodyPreview":"# Self-Heal\n\nQuiet companion skill. Watches for friction caused by skill instructions during live sessions. At task resolution, diagnoses root cause and proposes surgical fixes with user approval.\n\n**This skill does not run on demand.** It is embedded into other skills as an observer. When it detects a fixable source of friction, it surfaces automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Directives\n\n> **\"Updates to skills must be surgical -- one specific instruction, smallest possible change, nothing more.\"**\n\n*— Adde","body":"# Self-Heal\n\nQuiet companion skill. Watches for friction caused by skill instructions during live sessions. At task resolution, diagnoses root cause and proposes surgical fixes with user approval.\n\n**This skill does not run on demand.** It is embedded into other skills as an observer. When it detects a fixable source of friction, it surfaces automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Directives\n\n> **\"Updates to skills must be surgical -- one specific instruction, smallest possible change, nothing more.\"**\n\n*— Added 2026-02-26, source: system directive*\n\n> **\"Nothing is written to a skill file without explicit user approval and a visible before/after diff.\"**\n\n*— Added 2026-02-26, source: system directive*\n\n> **\"Self-heal never modifies directives. Directives are sacred. Only workflow instructions, context descriptions, and clarifying language are in scope.\"**\n\n*— Added 2026-02-26, source: system directive*\n\n---\n\n## Review Command\n\nWhen invoked as `/self-heal review`:\n\n1. List all skills that have the self-heal observer embedded\n2. Show count of friction events logged per skill (read each skill''s `self-heal-history.md` if it exists)\n3. Show count of patches applied vs. declined per skill\n4. Flag skills missing the observer — offer to embed\n\n---\n\n## Grounding\n\nBefore executing any diagnosis or update:\n1. Read the relevant file from `references/`\n2. State: \"I will use [PROTOCOL] from references/[file] under [SECTION]\"\n\nReference files:\n- [references/friction-signals.md](references/friction-signals.md) — Complete friction signal taxonomy\n- [references/diagnosis-protocol.md](references/diagnosis-protocol.md) — Root cause tracing procedure\n- [references/update-protocol.md](references/update-protocol.md) — Diff construction and approval workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:05:51.339Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code that require streamlined task resolution and automated friction detection.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，它们需要简化任务解决和自动化摩擦检测。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeのようなタスク解決の簡素化と自動フリクション検出を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 작업 해결을 단순화하고 자동 마찰 감지를 요구하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren una resolución de tareas optimizada y una detección de fricción automatizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui nécessitent une résolution de tâches rationalisée et une détection de friction automatisée.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine optimierte Aufgabenlösung und eine automatisierte Reibungserkennung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que exigem resolução de tarefas otimizada e detecção automática de atrito.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которые требуют оптимизированного решения задач и автоматического обнаружения трения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى حل مهام متدفق و كشف الاحتكاك التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose root causes of friction and propose surgical fixes using live session analysis, ensuring efficient task resolution with minimal user intervention and approval-based updates to skill instructions.","zh":"赋予代理诊断摩擦的根源并使用实时会话分析提出外科手术修复，确保最小用户干预和基于批准的更新到技能说明。","ja":"エージェントにフリクションの根本原因を診断し、ライブセッション分析を使用して外科的修正を提案する能力を与え、最小限のユーザー介入と承認ベースのスキル指示の更新でタスク解決を効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 마찰의 근본 원인을 진단하고 실시간 세션 분석을 사용하여 외과적 수정을 제안하여 최소한의 사용자 개입과 승인 기반의 스킬 지침 업데이트와 함께 작업 해결을 효율적으로 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diagnosticar las causas raíz de la fricción y proponer reparaciones quirúrgicas utilizando el análisis de sesión en vivo, garantizando una resolución de tareas eficiente con una intervención mínima del usuario y actualizaciones basadas en aprobación de las instrucciones de habilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer les causes profondes de la friction et de proposer des corrections chirurgicales en utilisant l''analyse de session en direct, garantissant une résolution de tâches efficace avec une intervention minimale de l''utilisateur et des mises à jour basées sur l''approbation des instructions de compétence.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Ursachen von Reibung zu diagnostizieren und chirurgische Korrekturen unter Verwendung der Live-Sitzungsanalyse vorzuschlagen, wodurch eine effiziente Aufgabenlösung mit minimaler Benutzereingriff und genehmigungsbasierter Aktualisierung der Fähigkeitsanweisungen gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar as causas raiz do atrito e propor soluções cirúrgicas usando análise de sessão ao vivo, garantindo resolução eficiente de tarefas com intervenção mínima do usuário e atualizações baseadas em aprovação para instruções de habilidade.","ru":"Позволяет агентам диагностировать основные причины трения и предлагать хирургические решения с помощью анализа живой сессии, обеспечивая эффективное решение задач с минимальным вмешательством пользователя и обновлениями на основе утверждения для инструкций навыков.","ar":"تمكن العميل من تشخيص أسباب الاحتكاك الجذري وطرح حلول جراحية باستخدام تحليل الدورة الحية، مما يضمن حل المهام بكفاءة مع تدخل محدود للمستخدم وتنفيذ تعليمات المهارة المعتمدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task resolution diagnostics","Debugging skill instruction friction","Optimizing live session performance"],"zh":["自动化任务解决诊断","调试技能说明摩擦","优化实时会话性能"],"ja":["タスク解決診断の自動化","スキル指示のフリクションのデバッグ","ライブセッションのパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["작업 해결 진단 자동화","스킬 지침 마찰 디버깅","실시간 세션 성능 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de diagnósticos de resolución de tareas","Depuración de fricción de instrucciones de habilidad","Optimización del rendimiento de la sesión en vivo"],"fr":["Automatisation des diagnostics de résolution de tâches","Débogage de la friction des instructions de compétence","Optimisation des performances de la session en direct"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenlösungsdiagnose","Fehlersuche bei der Reibung von Fähigkeitsanweisungen","Optimierung der Live-Sitzungsleistung"],"pt":["Automatizar diagnósticos de resolução de tarefas","Depurar atrito de instruções de habilidade","Otimizar desempenho de sessão ao vivo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать диагностику решения задач","Отладить трение инструкций навыка","Оптимизировать производительность живой сессии"],"ar":["توفير تشخيص تلقائي لمهام الحل","تصحيح عيوب تعليمات المهارات","تحسين أداء الجلسة الحية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not run on demand, must be embedded into other skills","Requires user approval for proposed fixes"],"zh":["不能按需运行，必须嵌入到其他技能中","需要用户批准提出的修复"],"ja":["要求に応じて実行できないため、他のスキルに埋め込む必要がある","提案された修正にユーザーの承認が必要"],"ko":["요청에 따라 실행할 수 없으므로 다른 스킬에 포함해야 함","제안된 수정에 사용자 승인이 필요"],"es":["No se ejecuta bajo demanda, debe estar integrado en otras habilidades","Requiere aprobación del usuario para las soluciones propuestas"],"fr":["Ne s''exécute pas sur demande, doit être intégré à d''autres compétences","Nécessite l''approbation de l''utilisateur pour les correctifs proposés"],"de":["Wird nicht auf Abruf ausgeführt, muss in andere Fähigkeiten eingebettet werden","Benötigt Benutzerzustimmung für vorgeschlagene Korrekturen"],"pt":["Não executa sob demanda, deve ser incorporado em outras habilidades","Exige aprovação do usuário para soluções propostas"],"ru":["Не запускается по требованию, должен быть встроен в другие навыки","Требует утверждения пользователя для предложенных решений"],"ar":["لا يعمل عند الطلب، يجب دمجه في مهارات أخرى","يتطلب موافقة المستخدم على الحلول المقترحة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"bbd3f0b332968d3d9e9b0233c0d73ce2732670c664526708afa6f3e5bf7ab126","qualityScore":26}');
