amientas de consulta en Windows","fr":"Review-tool-coverage est un outil qui audite et optimise les outils de consultation sous Windows","de":"Review-tool-coverage ist ein Tool, das die Abfrage-Tools in Windows audiert und optimiert","pt":"O review-tool-coverage é uma ferramenta de auditoria e otimização de query tools para Windows","ru":"Review-tool-coverage - это инструмент аудита и оптимизации query tools для Windows","ar":"review-tool-coverage هو أداة لفحص وتحسين أدوات الاستعلام للويندوز"},"features":{"en":["Audits query tools in `tools/` for fitness using parallelism where possible","Utilizes AutoHotkey for customized window management","Integrates with Komorebi for enhanced productivity","Supports structured answers via query tools (`tools/query_*.ps1`) without loading full files","Allows for niche tool usage referenced by skills when relevant"],"zh":["支持Komorebi集成","使用Autohotkey脚本","具有并行处理能力","优化Alt-Tab功能","提高生产力","支持Windows平台"],"ja":["Komorebi統合をサポート","Autohotkeyスクリプトを使用","並列処理能力を備える","Alt-Tab機能を最適化","生産性を向上させる","Windowsプラットフォームをサポート"],"ko":["Komorebi 통합 지원","Autohotkey 스크립트 사용","병렬 처리 능력 보유","Alt-Tab 기능 최적화","생산성 향상","Windows 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["Reemplazo de Alt-Tab para Windows","Integración con Komorebi","Uso de Autohotkey para la automatización","Auditoría de herramientas de consulta en paralelo","Optimización de la productividad en el escritorio de Windows"],"fr":["Remplacement de Alt-Tab pour Windows","Intégration avec Komorebi","Utilisation d''Autohotkey pour l''automatisation","Audit des outils de consultation en parallèle","Optimisation de la productivité sur le bureau Windows"],"de":["Alt-Tab-Ersatz für Windows","Integration mit Komorebi","Verwendung von Autohotkey für die Automatisierung","Auditoría von Abfrage-Tools in Paralell","Optimierung der Produktivität auf dem Windows-Desktop"],"pt":["Integração com o Komorebi","Otimização de ferramentas de consulta","Auditoria de query tools","Uso de paralelismo para melhorar a performance","Suporte a ferramentas de linha de comando (CLI)"],"ru":["Интеграция с Komorebi","Оптимизация инструментов запросов","Аудит query tools","Использование параллелизма для улучшения производительности","Поддержка командной строки (CLI)"],"ar":["دمج مع Komorebi","تحسين أدوات الاستعلام","فحص أدوات الاستعلام","استخدام التمويل للتحسين الأداء","دعم سطر الأوامر (CLI)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use review-tool-coverage","review-tool-coverage alternative","review-tool-coverage setup guide","what is review-tool-coverage","review-tool-coverage vs AutoHotkey","review-tool-coverage install","Komorebi integration with review-tool-coverage","Windows Alt-Tab replacement with review-tool-coverage","review-tool-coverage for developers","review-tool-coverage and productivity"],"zh":["review-tool-coverage","AI工具","Alt-Tab替代","Komorebi集成","Autohotkey脚本","Windows优化","生产力提高","AIエージェント工具"],"ja":["review-tool-coverage","AIエージェント","Alt-Tab代替","Komorebi統合","Autohotkeyスクリプト","Windows最適化","生産性向上","AIツール"],"ko":["review-tool-coverage","AI 에이전트","Alt-Tab 대체","Komorebi 통합","Autohotkey 스크립트","Windows 최적화","생산성 향상","AI 도구"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Herramientas de productividad","Reemplazo de Alt-Tab","Integración de Komorebi","Autohotkey","Auditoría de herramientas de consulta","Optimización de la productividad en Windows"],"fr":["Agents d''IA","Outils de productivité","Remplacement de Alt-Tab","Intégration de Komorebi","Autohotkey","Audit des outils de consultation","Optimisation de la productivité sur Windows"],"de":["KI-Agents","Produktivitätstools","Alt-Tab-Ersatz","Komorebi-Integration","Autohotkey","Abfrage-Tool-Auditoría","Produktivitäts-Optimierung auf Windows"],"pt":["review-tool-coverage","otimização de query tools","Komorebi","produtividade","ferramentas de consulta","auditoria de query tools","paralelismo","CLI"],"ru":["review-tool-coverage","оптимизация инструментов запросов","Komorebi","производительность","инструменты запросов","аудит query tools","параллелизм","CLI"],"ar":["review-tool-coverage","تحسين أدوات الاستعلام","Komorebi","الإنتاجية","أدوات الاستعلام","فحص أدوات الاستعلام","التمويل","CLI","أدوات الذكاء الإصطناعي"]}},"owner":"cwilliams5","repo":"Alt-Tabby","repoPath":"cwilliams5/Alt-Tabby","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T02:02:59Z","topics":["alt-tab","autohotkey","komorebi","productivity","window-manager","windows"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-tool-coverage","description":"Audit query tools for accuracy, gaps, and retirement candidates","bodyPreview":"Enter planning mode. Audit the query tools in `tools/` for fitness. Use parallelism where possible.\n\n## Context\n\nQuery tools (`tools/query_*.ps1`) exist to give structured answers without loading full files into context. CLAUDE.md lists only the most-used tools — niche tools are intentionally omitted to save per-session context, but they''re still referenced by skills when relevant. \"Unused by CLAUDE.md\" does NOT mean unused.\n\n## Current Inventory\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `query_c","body":"Enter planning mode. Audit the query tools in `tools/` for fitness. Use parallelism where possible.\n\n## Context\n\nQuery tools (`tools/query_*.ps1`) exist to give structured answers without loading full files into context. CLAUDE.md lists only the most-used tools — niche tools are intentionally omitted to save per-session context, but they''re still referenced by skills when relevant. \"Unused by CLAUDE.md\" does NOT mean unused.\n\n## Current Inventory\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `query_config.ps1` | Config registry search — sections, groups, usage |\n| `query_function.ps1` | Extract function body by name |\n| `query_function_visibility.ps1` | Function definition, public/private, all callers |\n| `query_global_ownership.ps1` | Global declaration, writers, readers, manifest |\n| `query_instrumentation.ps1` | Profiler coverage map |\n| `query_interface.ps1` | File public surface (functions + globals) |\n| `query_ipc.ps1` | IPC message senders/handlers |\n| `query_messages.ps1` | Windows message (WM_) handler/sender mapping |\n| `query_profile.py` | Speedscope profile analysis |\n| `query_state.ps1` | State machine branch extractor |\n| `query_timers.ps1` | SetTimer inventory by file |\n| `query_visibility.ps1` | Public functions with few external callers |\n\n## Audit Steps\n\n### 1. Accuracy — do tools match the codebase?\n\nRun each `query_*.ps1` tool with no args (or a known-good sample query) and check:\n- Does the output parse the current file format correctly?\n- Have any source files been renamed, restructured, or split since the tool was written?\n- Are regex patterns still matching the right constructs?\n\nFlag tools that produce **silently wrong** output (no errors, but stale/incorrect data). A tool that errors loudly is less dangerous than one that lies quietly.\n\n### 2. Gaps — are there new \"load big file to find small answer\" patterns?\n\nLook for patterns in the codebase that suggest a missing tool:\n- Files over 300 lines where agents typically only need a small slice\n- Common grep patterns that could return structured answers instead of raw lines\n- Questions that require cross-referencing multiple files (e.g., \"who sends message X and who handles it\" — `query_messages.ps1` already covers this for WM_ messages; is there an equivalent need for other patterns?)\n\nThe bar: would a new tool save **>50 lines of context per use**? If not, grep is fine.\n\n### 3. Retirement — are any tools dead weight?\n\nA tool nobody invokes is dead code with maintenance cost. Check:\n- Is the tool referenced by any skill in `.claude/skills/`?\n- Is the tool listed in CLAUDE.md?\n- Does the tool''s domain still exist in the codebase? (e.g., if a subsystem was removed, its query tool should go too)\n\nNote: a tool referenced only by skills (not CLAUDE.md) is NOT a retirement candidate — it''s a niche tool by design.\n\n### 4. Cross-references — could existing skills benefit from niche tools?\n\nCheck each skill in `.claude/skills/` — could any benefit from referencing a query tool they don''t currently mention? Skills only load on invocation, so adding a niche tool reference costs zero per-session context.\n\n## Plan Format\n\n**Section 1 — Accuracy issues** (tools producing wrong output):\n\n| Tool | Issue | Fix |\n|------|-------|-----|\n| `query_config.ps1` | Registry format changed, parser misses `fmt` field | Update regex on line 42 |\n\n**Section 2 — Gap candidates** (potential new tools):\n\n| Pattern | Frequency | Context Saved | Recommendation |\n|---------|-----------|--------------|----------------|\n| \"Which files #Include X\" | ~2/session | ~80 lines | New tool: `query_includes.ps1` |\n\n**Section 3 — Retirement candidates** (genuinely unused):\n\n| Tool | Last Relevant Use | Recommendation |\n|------|------------------|----------------|\n| `query_foo.ps1` | Subsystem removed in v0.7 | Delete |\n\n**Section 4 — Skill cross-references** (niche tools that skills should mention):\n\n| Skill | Tool to Add | Why |\n|-------|------------|-----|\n| `review-dead-code` | `query_visibility.ps1` | Finds public functions with 0 callers |\n\nIgnore any existing plans — create a fresh one.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:10:45.015Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Windows Management Agents needing efficient window switching and query tool auditing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效窗口切换和查询工具审计功能的 Windows 管理代理。","ja":"Windows 管理エージェントが効率的なウィンドウ切り替えとクエリツールの監査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"윈도우 관리 에이전트가 효율적인 창 전환 및 쿼리 도구 감사 기능을 필요로 할 때 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de administración de Windows que necesitan un cambio de ventana eficiente y capacidades de auditoría de herramientas de consulta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de Windows nécessitant un commutateur de fenêtres efficace et des capacités d''audit d''outils de requête.","de":"Perfekt für Windows-Verwaltungsagenten, die ein effizientes Fensterwechseln und Abfrage-Tool-Prüfmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de gerenciamento do Windows que necessitam de troca de janelas eficiente e capacidades de auditoria de ferramentas de consulta.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления Windows, которым необходима эффективная переключение окон и возможности аудита инструментов запросов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة ويندوز الذي يحتاج إلى تبديل النوافذ بكفاءة وقدرات تدقيق أدوات الاستعلام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to audit query tools in parallel, leveraging PowerShell scripts and integrated Komorebi functionality for streamlined window management, utilizing tools like `tools/query_*.ps1` for structured answers without loading full files into context.","zh":"赋予代理以并行方式审计查询工具的能力，利用 PowerShell 脚本和集成的 Komorebi 功能进行流畅的窗口管理，使用诸如 `tools/query_*.ps1` 的工具来获取结构化答案，而无需将整个文件加载到上下文中。","ja":"エージェントがクエリツールを並列で監査する能力を提供し、PowerShell スクリプトと統合された Komorebi 機能を使用してスムーズなウィンドウ管理を実現し、`tools/query_*.ps1` などのツールを使用して、コンテキストに完全なファイルを読み込むことなく構造化された回答を取得します。","ko":"에이전트가 쿼리 도구를 병렬로 감사할 수 있는 능력을 제공하고 PowerShell 스크립트와 통합된 Komorebi 기능을 사용하여 매끄러운 창 관리를 실현하며 `tools/query_*.ps1` 등의 도구를 사용하여 전체 파일을 컨텍스트에 로드하지 않고 구조화된 답변을 얻습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a auditar herramientas de consulta en paralelo, aprovechando scripts de PowerShell y la funcionalidad integrada de Komorebi para una gestión de ventanas optimizada, utilizando herramientas como `tools/query_*.ps1` para respuestas estructuradas sin cargar archivos completos en el contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''auditer des outils de requête en parallèle, en exploitant les scripts PowerShell et la fonctionnalité intégrée de Komorebi pour une gestion de fenêtres optimisée, en utilisant des outils tels que `tools/query_*.ps1` pour des réponses structurées sans charger les fichiers complets dans le contexte.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Abfrage-Tools parallel zu überprüfen, indem PowerShell-Skripte und die integrierte Komorebi-Funktionalität für eine optimierte Fensterverwaltung genutzt werden, unter Verwendung von Tools wie `tools/query_*.ps1` für strukturierte Antworten, ohne vollständige Dateien in den Kontext zu laden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a auditarem ferramentas de consulta em paralelo, utilizando scripts PowerShell e funcionalidade Komorebi integrada para gerenciamento de janelas otimizado, utilizando ferramentas como `tools/query_*.ps1` para respostas estruturadas sem carregar arquivos inteiros no contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аудита инструментов запросов параллельно, используя скрипты PowerShell и интегрированную функциональность Komorebi для оптимизированного управления окнами, используя инструменты như `tools/query_*.ps1` для структурированных ответов без загрузки полных файлов в контекст.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تدقيق أدوات الاستعلام بالتوازي، باستخدام سكريبتات PowerShell والوظائف المتكاملة من Komorebi لتحسين إدارة النوافذ، باستخدام أدوات مثل `tools/query_*.ps1` للحصول على إجابات منسقة دون تحميل الملفات الكاملة في السياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing query tools for fitness and optimization","Integrating with Komorebi for enhanced window management","Utilizing parallelism for efficient tool auditing and analysis"],"zh":["为查询工具进行健全性和优化的审计","与 Komorebi 集成以增强窗口管理","利用并行性进行高效的工具审计和分析"],"ja":["フィットネスと最適化のためのクエリツールの監査","Komorebi との統合によるウィンドウ管理の強化","並列性を利用したツールの監査と分析の効率化"],"ko":["적합성과 최적화를 위한 쿼리 도구의 감사","Komorebi와의 통합을 통한 창 관리의 강화","병렬성을 활용한 도구의 감사와 분석의 효율화"],"es":["Auditoría de herramientas de consulta para la idoneidad y la optimización","Integración con Komorebi para una gestión de ventanas mejorada","Uso de la paralelización para una auditoría y análisis eficientes de herramientas"],"fr":["Audit des outils de requête pour l''aptitude et l''optimisation","Intégration avec Komorebi pour une gestion de fenêtres améliorée","Utilisation du parallélisme pour une audit et une analyse efficaces des outils"],"de":["Überprüfung von Abfrage-Tools auf Eignung und Optimierung","Integration mit Komorebi für eine verbesserte Fensterverwaltung","Verwendung von Parallelverarbeitung für eine effiziente Überprüfung und Analyse von Tools"],"pt":["Auditoria de ferramentas de consulta para aptidão e otimização","Integração com Komorebi para gerenciamento de janelas aprimorado","Utilização de paralelismo para auditoria de ferramentas eficiente e análise"],"ru":["Аудит инструментов запросов для пригодности и оптимизации","Интеграция с Komorebi для улучшенного управления окнами","Использование параллелизма для эффективной аудита инструментов и анализа"],"ar":["تدقيق أدوات الاستعلام لللياقة والتحسين","التكامل مع Komorebi لتحسين إدارة النوافذ","استخدام التوالى لتدقيق أدوات فعال وتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows operating system","Dependent on Komorebi integration","Limited to auditing query tools in `tools/` directory"],"zh":["需要 Windows 操作系统","依赖于 Komorebi 集成","仅限于 `tools/` 目录中的查询工具进行审计"],"ja":["Windows オペレーティングシステムが必要","Komorebi 統合に依存","`tools/` ディレクトリ内のクエリツールのみを監査"],"ko":["윈도우 운영 체제가 필요","Komorebi 통합에 의존","`tools/` 디렉토리 내의 쿼리 도구만을 감사"],"es":["Requiere sistema operativo Windows","Dependiente de la integración de Komorebi","Limitado a la auditoría de herramientas de consulta en el directorio `tools/`"],"fr":["Nécessite le système d''exploitation Windows","Dépend de l''intégration de Komorebi","Limité à l''audit des outils de requête dans le répertoire `tools/`"],"de":["Benötigt Windows-Betriebssystem","Abhängig von der Komorebi-Integration","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung von Abfrage-Tools im Verzeichnis `tools/`"],"pt":["Exige sistema operacional Windows","Dependente da integração com Komorebi","Limitado à auditoria de ferramentas de consulta no diretório `tools/`"],"ru":["Требует операционной системы Windows","Зависит от интеграции с Komorebi","Ограничен аудитом инструментов запросов в каталоге `tools/`"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام تشغيل ويندوز","يعتمد على التكامل مع Komorebi","محدود بتدقيق أدوات الاستعلام في الدليل `tools/`"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1e73ebaf48415347d7ec9714594bf48c792c06bddd8ac3fa3d693640798e1d41","qualityScore":26}');
