d Executes all activation steps exactly as written in the agent file Follows the agent''s persona and menu system precisely Requires reading of the entire agent file contents for complete understanding Utilizes <agent-activation> commands with CRITICAL flags Supports precise character instruction adherence bmad-agent-cis-storyteller is a specialized AI agent skill that requires exact activation instructions and persona embodiment for effective utilization.');
