ns.","zh":"devil-advocate 是一种技术文档生成工具，用于生成生产就绪的文档包","ja":"devil-advocate は、技術文書を生成する AIエージェントです","ko":"devil-advocate 는 기술문서를 자동 생성하는 도구입니다","es":"El agente devil-advocate es una herramienta de análisis que evalúa tecnologías y decisiones arquitectónicas","fr":"L''agent devil-advocate est un outil d''analyse qui évalue les technologies et les décisions d''architecture","de":"Der devil-advocate-Agent ist ein Analysewerkzeug, das Technologien und architektonische Entscheidungen bewertet","pt":"O que é Devil-Advocate? É um agente de análise de ideias que ajuda a tomar decisões informadas sobre tecnologia e arquitetura","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Devil-Advocate? Это агент анализа идей, который помогает принимать обоснованные решения о технологиях и архитектуре","ar":"ما هو Devil-Advocate؟ هو وكيل تحليل الأفكار الذي يساعد في اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة حول التكنولوجيا والهندسة المعمارية"},"features":{"en":["Activates on technology choices, such as database or framework selections","Supports Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) documentation","Facilitates build-vs-buy decisions with a structured approach","Automatically triggers after every document generation","Helps with feature prioritization involving significant tradeoffs"],"zh":["支持技术选择和架构决策的文档生成","提供结构化的文档生成方法","适用于数据库、框架、托管等技术选择","支持 ADR 文档生成","支持构建与购买决策的文档生成","支持每次文档生成后的自动触发"],"ja":["技術選択やアーキテクチャ決定時のドキュメント生成をサポート","構造化されたドキュメント生成方法を提供","データベース、フレームワーク、ホスティングなどの技術選択に対応","ADR 文書生成をサポート","ビルドと購入の決定時のドキュメント生成をサポート","毎回の文書生成後に自動的にトリガーを発生させる"],"ko":["기술 선택과 아키텍처 결정의 문서 자동 생성","구조화된 문서 생성 방법 제공","데이터베이스, 프레임워크, 호스팅 등의 기술 선택 지원","ADR 문서 자동 생성 지원","빌드와 구매 결정의 문서 자동 생성 지원","매번 문서 생성 후 자동으로 트리거 발생"],"es":["Análisis de tecnologías y decisiones arquitectónicas","Evaluación de riesgos no obvios en enfoques tecnológicos","Priorización de características con importantes compensaciones","Generación automática de documentación después de cada decisión","Activación en situaciones de elección de tecnología, documentación de ADR y decisión de construir o comprar","Integración con la generación de documentación de producción"],"fr":["Analyse de technologies et de décisions d''architecture","Évaluation des risques non évidents dans les approches technologiques","Priorisation des fonctionnalités avec des compromis importants","Génération automatique de documentation après chaque décision","Activation dans les situations de choix de technologie, de documentation de ADR et de décision de construire ou d''acheter","Intégration avec la génération de documentation de production"],"de":["Analyse von Technologien und architektonischen Entscheidungen","Bewertung von nicht offensichtlichen Risiken in technologischen Ansätzen","Priorisierung von Funktionen mit wichtigen Kompromissen","Automatische Generierung von Dokumentation nach jeder Entscheidung","Aktivierung in Situationen der Technologieauswahl, ADR-Dokumentation und Entscheidung zwischen Eigenentwicklung und Kauf","Integration mit der Generierung von Produktionsdokumentation"],"pt":["Análise de ideias e documentação de tecnologia","Escolha de banco de dados e frameworks","Análise de arquitetura e decisões de design","Priorização de recursos e gerenciamento de tradeoffs","Geração automática de documentação após cada análise"],"ru":["Анализ идей и документация технологий","Выбор баз данных и фреймворков","Анализ архитектуры и решения по дизайну","Приоритизация функций и управление tradeoffs","Автоматическая генерация документации после каждого анализа"],"ar":["تحليل الأفكار وتوثيق التكنولوجيا","اختيار قواعد البيانات والإطارات","تحليل الهندسة المعمارية واختيارات التصميم","التحديد الأولوي لالميزات وإدارة التبادل","التوليد التلقائي للوثائق بعد كل تحليل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use devil-advocate","what is devil-advocate","devil-advocate alternative","devil-advocate vs competitor","devil-advocate install","devil-advocate setup guide","idea-to-documentation conversion","structured analysis for AI agents"],"zh":["devil-advocate 技术文档生成工具","技术选择文档生成","架构决策文档生成","数据库文档生成","框架文档生成","ADR 文档生成","构建与购买决策文档生成","自动文档生成工具"],"ja":["devil-advocate AIエージェント","技術選択ドキュメント生成","アーキテクチャ決定ドキュメント生成","データベースドキュメント生成","フレームワークドキュメント生成","ADR ドキュメント生成","ビルドと購入の決定ドキュメント生成","自動ドキュメント生成ツール"],"ko":["devil-advocate 문서 자동 생성 도구","기술 선택 문서 자동 생성","아키텍처 결정 문서 자동 생성","데이터베이스 문서 자동 생성","프레임워크 문서 자동 생성","ADR 문서 자동 생성","빌드와 구매 결정 문서 자동 생성","자동 문서 생성 도구"],"es":["agente devil-advocate","análisis de tecnologías","evaluación de riesgos","priorización de características","generación de documentación","herramientas de desarrollo","tecnologías de desarrollo","devops","ingeniería de software","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["agent devil-advocate","analyse de technologies","évaluation de risques","priorisation de fonctionnalités","génération de documentation","outils de développement","technologies de développement","devops","ingénierie logicielle","développement logiciel"],"de":["devil-advocate-Agent","Analyse von Technologien","Bewertung von Risiken","Priorisierung von Funktionen","Generierung von Dokumentation","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungstechnologien","devops","Softwareingenieurwesen","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Devil-Advocate","análise de ideias","documentação de tecnologia","escolha de banco de dados","frameworks","arquitetura","priorização de recursos","gerenciamento de tradeoffs"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Devil-Advocate","анализ идей","документация технологий","выбор баз данных","фреймворки","архитектура","приоритизация функций","управление tradeoffs"],"ar":["Devil-Advocate","تحليل الأفكار","توثيق التكنولوجيا","اختيار قواعد البيانات","الإطارات","الهندسة المعمارية","التحديد الأولوي للميزات","إدارة التبادل"]}},"owner":"igorder-dev","repo":"apex","repoPath":"igorder-dev/apex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T21:48:26Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devil-advocate","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Devil''s Advocate Analysis (Enhanced)\n\nWhen performing devil''s advocate analysis, follow this structured approach:\n\n## Trigger Conditions\nActivate this skill when:\n- A technology choice is being made (database, framework, hosting, etc.)\n- An architectural decision is being documented in an ADR\n- A build-vs-buy decision arises\n- The user is confident in an approach that has non-obvious risks\n- Feature prioritization involves significant tradeoffs\n- **After every document generation** (automatic","body":"# Devil''s Advocate Analysis (Enhanced)\n\nWhen performing devil''s advocate analysis, follow this structured approach:\n\n## Trigger Conditions\nActivate this skill when:\n- A technology choice is being made (database, framework, hosting, etc.)\n- An architectural decision is being documented in an ADR\n- A build-vs-buy decision arises\n- The user is confident in an approach that has non-obvious risks\n- Feature prioritization involves significant tradeoffs\n- **After every document generation** (automatic — scope critique)\n\n## Analysis Structure\n\n### Level 1: Decision Critique\n\n#### 1. Steel-man the current position\nBefore attacking, present the BEST case for the current choice. This shows fairness and ensures the critique is against a strong version of the argument.\n\n#### 2. Identify the three biggest risks\nFor each risk:\n- **Probability**: How likely is this to happen? (cite evidence)\n- **Impact**: What happens if it does?\n- **Detectability**: Will we know before it''s too late?\n- **Mitigation**: Can we reduce the risk while keeping the choice?\n\n#### 3. Name the best alternative\nNot a strawman — the genuine best alternative approach. Explain when it would be the right choice.\n\n#### 4. Identify reversibility\n- **Easily reversible**: Low-cost to change later → proceed with less analysis\n- **Costly to reverse**: Significant migration → more analysis warranted\n- **Irreversible**: Permanent commitment → maximum scrutiny required\n\n#### 5. Deliver verdict\nAlways end with a clear, actionable recommendation. Never leave the user in analysis paralysis.\n\n### Level 2: Scope Critique (Run after every document)\nAsk these SPECIFIC questions:\n- **\"What did we FORGET?\"** — actively search for missing requirements\n- **\"What breaks when this fails?\"** — failure mode analysis\n- **\"What does the user need that they didn''t ask for?\"** — implicit requirements\n- **\"What would a regulatory auditor / security researcher / angry customer flag?\"**\n\n### Level 3: \"First Day on the Job\" Test\nImagine a developer reading this doc pack on Day 1:\n- Can they set up the project without asking questions?\n- Do they know which doc to read for which task?\n- Is there a clear path from \"I just cloned the repo\" to \"I deployed my first change\"?\n- Are gotchas and non-obvious constraints highlighted?\n\n## Minimum Gaps Rule\nThe devil''s advocate MUST identify at least 2 potential gaps or concerns per document.\nIf you genuinely can''t find any, state: \"No gaps identified — this document is comprehensive.\"\nThis forces active gap-seeking rather than rubber-stamping.\n\n## Tone\n- Respectful but direct\n- Evidence-based, not opinion-based\n- Acknowledge when the current choice IS the best option\n- Never artificially inflate risks to seem thorough\n- Focus on SCOPE gaps (what''s missing?) not just DECISION quality (is this the right choice?)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:40:29.074Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Architect Agents needing structured decision-making and risk analysis capabilities for technology choices and architectural decisions","zh":"非常适合需要结构化决策和风险分析能力以进行技术选择和架构决策的架构代理","ja":"アーキテクチャエージェントが技術的な選択とアーキテクチャ上の決定に対して構造化された意思決定とリスク分析機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"기술 선택과 아키텍처 결정에 구조화된 의사 결정 및 리스크 분석 기능이 필요한 아키텍트 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Arquitectura que necesitan toma de decisiones estructurada y capacidades de análisis de riesgos para elecciones tecnológicas y decisiones arquitectónicas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''architecture ayant besoin d''une prise de décision structurée et de capacités d''analyse de risques pour les choix technologiques et les décisions architecturales","de":"Perfekt für Architekturagenten, die eine strukturierte Entscheidungsfindung und Risikoanalysefähigkeiten für Technologieentscheidungen und Architekturentscheidungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Arquitetos que precisam de tomada de decisão estruturada e capacidades de análise de risco para escolhas tecnológicas e decisões arquiteturais","ru":"Идеально подходит для Архитектурных Агентов, требующих структурированного процесса принятия решений и возможностей анализа рисков для технологических выборов и архитектурных решений","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهندسة المعمارية الذين يحتاجون إلى اتخاذ قرارات منظمة وقدرات تحليل المخاطر للخيارات التكنولوجية والقرارات الهندسية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to critically evaluate technology choices, architectural decisions, and build-vs-buy decisions using a systematic devil''s advocate approach, incorporating trigger conditions and generating production-ready documentation packs in ADR format","zh":"赋予代理批判性地评估技术选择、架构决策和自建与购买决策的能力，使用系统化的反对意见方法，结合触发条件，并生成生产就绪文档包以ADR格式","ja":"エージェントに技術選択、アーキテクチャ上の決定、ビルド対購入の決定を体系的なデビルズアドボケイトアプローチで批判的に評価する能力を付与し、トリガーコンディションを組み込み、ADR形式のプロダクションレディなドキュメントパックを生成する","ko":"에이전트가 기술 선택, 아키텍처 결정 및 빌드 대 구매 결정에 대한 체계적인 반대 의견 접근 방식을 사용하여 비판적으로 평가할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 트리거 조건을 통합하고 ADR 형식의 프로덕션 준비 문서 패키지를 생성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar críticamente las elecciones tecnológicas, las decisiones arquitectónicas y las decisiones de construcción versus compra utilizando un enfoque sistemático de abogado del diablo, incorporando condiciones de activación y generando paquetes de documentación de producción listos en formato ADR","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer de manière critique les choix technologiques, les décisions architecturales et les décisions de construction versus achat en utilisant une approche systématique de l''avocat du diable, en incorporant des conditions de déclenchement et en générant des packs de documentation de production prêts au format ADR","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Technologieentscheidungen, Architekturentscheidungen und Build-vs.-Buy-Entscheidungen mit einem systematischen Advokat-des-Teufels-Ansatz zu bewerten, Auslösebedingungen einzubinden und produktionsbereite Dokumentationspakete im ADR-Format zu generieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar criticamente as escolhas tecnológicas, decisões arquiteturais e decisões de construção versus compra usando uma abordagem sistemática de advogado do diabo, incorporando condições de gatilho e gerando pacotes de documentação prontos para produção no formato ADR","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью критически оценивать технологические выборы, архитектурные решения и решения о построении или покупке, используя системный подход адвоката дьявола, включающий условия триггера и генерирующий пакеты документации, готовые к производству, в формате ADR","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تقييم الخيارات التكنولوجية والقرارات الهندسية وقرارات البناء مقابل الشراء بشكل نقدي باستخدام نهج منهجي لمحامي الشيطان ، ودمج شروط التفعيل وتوليد حزم الوثائق الجاهزة للإنتاج بالتنسيق ADR"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating risk analysis for non-obvious technology choices","Generating structured documentation for architectural decisions","Evaluating build-vs-buy decisions with significant tradeoffs","Identifying potential risks in feature prioritization"],"zh":["自动化非明显技术选择的风险分析","为架构决策生成结构化文档","使用系统化方法评估具有显著权衡的自建与购买决策","在功能优先级中确定潜在风险"],"ja":["明らかでない技術選択のリスク分析の自動化","アーキテクチャ上の決定のための構造化ドキュメントの生成","重大なトレードオフを伴うビルド対購入の決定の体系的な評価","機能の優先順位付けにおける潜在的なリスクの特定"],"ko":["불분명한 기술 선택의 리스크 분석 자동화","아키텍처 결정의 구조화된 문서 생성","중대한 트레이드 오프를 가진 빌드 대 구매 결정의 체계적인 평가","기능 우선순위에서 잠재적인 리스크 식별"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis de riesgos para elecciones tecnológicas no obvias","Generar documentación estructurada para decisiones arquitectónicas","Evaluar decisiones de construcción versus compra con compensaciones significativas","Identificar posibles riesgos en la priorización de características"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse des risques pour les choix technologiques non évidents","Générer une documentation structurée pour les décisions architecturales","Évaluer les décisions de construction versus achat avec des compromis significatifs","Identifier les risques potentiels dans la priorisation des fonctionnalités"],"de":["Automatisierung der Risikoanalyse für nicht offensichtliche Technologieentscheidungen","Erzeugen strukturierter Dokumentation für Architekturentscheidungen","Bewerten von Build-vs.-Buy-Entscheidungen mit wesentlichen Kompromissen","Identifizierung potenzieller Risiken bei der Priorisierung von Funktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de risco para escolhas tecnológicas não óbvias","Gerar documentação estruturada para decisões arquiteturais","Avaliar decisões de construção versus compra com tradeoffs significativos","Identificar riscos potenciais na priorização de recursos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ рисков для неочевидных технологических выборов","Генерировать структурированную документацию для архитектурных решений","Оценивать решения о построении или покупке с существенными компромиссами","Определить потенциальные риски приоритизации функций"],"ar":["أتمتة تحليل المخاطر للخيارات التكنولوجية غير الواضحة","توليد وثائق منظمة للقرارات الهندسية","تقييم قرارات البناء مقابل الشراء بالتضحيات المهمة","تحديد المخاطر المحتملة في تحديد أولويات الميزات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires activation by specific trigger conditions","Limited to decision-making and risk analysis contexts"],"zh":["需要特定触发条件激活","仅限决策和风险分析场景"],"ja":["特定のトリガーコンディションによる有効化が必要","決策とリスク分析のコンテキストに限定"],"ko":["특정 트리거 조건에 의한 활성화 필요","의사 결정 및 리스크 분석 컨텍스트에 한정"],"es":["Requiere activación por condiciones de activación específicas","Limitado a contextos de toma de decisiones y análisis de riesgos"],"fr":["Nécessite une activation par des conditions de déclenchement spécifiques","Limité aux contextes de prise de décision et d''analyse de risques"],"de":["Erfordert eine Aktivierung durch spezifische Auslösebedingungen","Begrenzt auf Entscheidungsfindungs- und Risikoanalysekontexte"],"pt":["Exige ativação por condições de gatilho específicas","Limitado a contextos de tomada de decisão e análise de risco"],"ru":["Требует активации конкретными условиями триггера","Ограничен контекстами принятия решений и анализа рисков"],"ar":["يتطلب تفعيلًا من شروط تفعيل محددة","محدود السياقات لاتخاذ القرارات وتحليل المخاطر"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"02395d757066ecb8c53db7c9db11e3446514b32e7da01c738f7aab6de6f5915d","qualityScore":26}');
