cesses.","zh":"Convert Develop 是一个用于步骤提取和规范化的 AI 工具","ja":"Convert Develop はステップ抽出と正規化を実行する AI エージェントです","ko":"Convert Develop는 단계 추출 및 정규화를 수행하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"Convert-develop es una herramienta de desarrollo que permite la conversión y mejora de código","fr":"Convert-develop est un outil de développement qui permet la conversion et l''amélioration de code","de":"Convert-develop ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Konvertierung und Verbesserung von Code ermöglicht","pt":"O Convert Develop é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que ajuda a extrair e normalizar números de etapas.","ru":"Инструмент Convert Develop - это инструмент разработки, который помогает извлекать и нормализовать номера шагов.","ar":"أداة Convert Develop هي أداة تطوير تساعد في استخراج وتعديل أرقام الخطوات."},"features":{"en":["Extracts step numbers from requests and normalizes to 4 digits","Locates matching STEP sections in convert-progress.md","Aligns with current design and flow by reading convert-architecture.md and convert-workflow.md","Identifies dependencies and prior steps for revision","Marks superseded content with strikethroughs"],"zh":["步骤提取和规范化","文档读取和处理","依存关系识别和处理"," strikethrough 标记用于表示过时内容","与当前设计和流程对齐"],"ja":["ステップ抽出と正規化","ドキュメントの読み取りと処理","依存関係の識別と処理","ストライクスルー表記を使用して古いコンテンツを示す","現在の設計とフローに合わせる"],"ko":["단계 추출 및 정규화","문서 읽기 및 처리","의존성 식별 및 처리","취소선 표시를 사용하여 구식 콘텐츠를 표시","현재 디자인 및 워크플로에 맞추기"],"es":["Extracción de números de paso y normalización a 4 dígitos","Lectura de archivos de progreso y arquitectura","Identificación de dependencias y pasos previos","Uso de marcado de contenido obsoleto con tachados","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como CLI"],"fr":["Extraction de numéros d''étape et normalisation à 4 chiffres","Lecture de fichiers de progrès et d''architecture","Identification de dépendances et d''étapes précédentes","Utilisation de marquage de contenu obsolète avec barrages","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme CLI"],"de":["Extraktion von Schrittnummern und Normalisierung auf 4 Ziffern","Lesevorgang für Fortschritts- und Architekturdateien","Identifizierung von Abhängigkeiten und vorherigen Schritten","Verwendung von Durchstreichungsmarkierung für veralteten Inhalt","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie CLI"],"pt":["Extração de números de etapas","Normalização para 4 dígitos","Abertura de arquivos de documentação","Captura de alvos e planos","Identificação de dependências"],"ru":["Извлечение номеров шагов","Нормализация до 4 цифр","Открытие файлов документации","Захват целей и планов","Определение зависимостей"],"ar":["استخراج أرقام الخطوات","تعديل إلى 4 أرقام","فتح ملفات الوثائق","التقاط الأهداف والمخططات","تحديد التبعيات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use convert-develop","convert-develop setup guide","what is convert-develop","convert-develop alternative","convert-develop vs competing tools","convert-develop install","convert-develop technical documentation"],"zh":["AI 工具","步骤提取","规范化","文档处理","依存关系","Convert Develop","AI 에이전트","技术文档"],"ja":["AI エージェント","ステップ抽出","正規化","ドキュメント処理","依存関係","Convert Develop","AI ツール","技術文書"],"ko":["AI 도구","단계 추출","정규화","문서 처리","의존성","Convert Develop","AI 에이전트","기술 문서"],"es":["convert-develop","herramientas de desarrollo","conversión de código","mejora de código","desarrollo de software","guias de configuración","Agentes de IA para desarrolladores","CLI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["convert-develop","outils de développement","conversion de code","amélioration de code","développement de logiciels","guides de configuration","Agents de l''IA pour les développeurs","CLI pour les développeurs"],"de":["convert-develop","Entwicklungstools","Code-Konvertierung","Code-Verbesserung","Software-Entwicklung","Konfigurationsleitfäden","KI-Agents für Entwickler","CLI für Entwickler"],"pt":["Convert Develop","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","extração de números de etapas","normalização de números","documentação de software","desenvolvedores de software"],"ru":["Convert Develop","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","извлечение номеров шагов","нормализация номеров","документация программного обеспечения","разработчики программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Convert Develop","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","استخراج أرقام الخطوات","تعديل الأرقام","وثائق البرمجيات","مطورو البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Wolf-Tungsten","repo":"wolvrix-playground","repoPath":"Wolf-Tungsten/wolvrix-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T12:21:30Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convert-develop","description":"Standardize development for Convert steps in wolf-sv-parser. Use when asked to implement, continue, or review a Convert STEP XXXX task (e.g., convert step 17). Cover reading docs/convert/convert-progress.md, implementing code/tests, updating docs/convert/{convert-architecture,convert-workflow,convert-progress}, and asking for review.","bodyPreview":"# Convert Develop\n\n## Intake\n\n- Extract the step number from the request and normalize to 4 digits (e.g., 17 -> 0017).\n- Open `docs/convert/convert-progress.md` and locate the matching STEP section to capture target/plan/implementation.\n- Read `docs/convert/convert-architecture.md` and `docs/convert/convert-workflow.md` to align with the current design and flow.\n- Identify dependencies or prior steps that are being revised; plan to mark superseded content with strikethroughs.\n- Ask for clarifica","body":"# Convert Develop\n\n## Intake\n\n- Extract the step number from the request and normalize to 4 digits (e.g., 17 -> 0017).\n- Open `docs/convert/convert-progress.md` and locate the matching STEP section to capture target/plan/implementation.\n- Read `docs/convert/convert-architecture.md` and `docs/convert/convert-workflow.md` to align with the current design and flow.\n- Identify dependencies or prior steps that are being revised; plan to mark superseded content with strikethroughs.\n- Ask for clarification when the STEP definition is missing or ambiguous.\n\n## Implementation\n\n- Follow `AGENTS.md` and existing patterns in `include/convert.hpp`, `src/convert.cpp`, and related files.\n- Keep includes minimal; use C++20, 4-space indentation, and same-line braces.\n- Keep comments terse and avoid non-ASCII identifiers.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Add or extend tests under `tests/convert/` with fixtures in `tests/data/convert/`.\n- Register new test targets in `CMakeLists.txt` following the existing `convert-*` pattern and compile definitions.\n- Proactively run configure/build/tests: `cmake -S . -B build` (if needed), `cmake --build build -j$(nproc)`, then `ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure` (or `ctest -R convert-...`).\n- If the user requests not to run tests or the environment blocks execution, explicitly state what was skipped and why.\n\n## Documentation Updates\n\n- Update `docs/convert/convert-architecture.md` as a static, top-down description of components and relationships.\n- Update `docs/convert/convert-workflow.md` as a runtime, front-to-back description of execution flow.\n- Keep documentation organized from general to specific; after stating principles, add a concrete example.\n- Append a new STEP section to `docs/convert/convert-progress.md` after the separator; preserve target/plan/implementation/finish status fields.\n\n## Review Handoff\n\n- Summarize code/test/doc changes and list tests executed.\n- Ask the user to review or confirm next actions.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:49:17.080Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined workflow management and content normalization.","zh":"适合需要简化工作流管理和内容规范化的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがワークフロー管理とコンテンツの正規化を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"워크플ロー 관리와 콘텐츠 표준화를 단순화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo optimizada y normalización de contenido.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow simplifiée et de normalisation de contenu.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte Workflow-Verwaltung und Inhaltsnormalisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho otimizado e normalização de conteúdo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент рабочих процессов и нормализация контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل المُبسطة وتعتيق المحتوى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract and normalize step numbers, capture target plans, and align with current design and flow using Markdown files and strikethrough formatting for superseded content.","zh":"赋予代理提取和规范化步骤编号、捕获目标计划并使用 Markdown 文件和删除线格式对过时内容与当前设计和流程保持一致的能力。","ja":"エージェントがステップ番号を抽出して正規化し、ターゲットプランをキャプチャし、Markdown ファイルと取り消し線形式を使用して過去のコンテンツを現在のデザインとフローに合わせる能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 단계 번호를 추출하여 표준화하고 대상 계획을 캡처하며 Markdown 파일과 취소선 형식을 사용하여 구식 콘텐츠를 현재 디자인 및 흐름과 일치시키는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer y normalizar números de paso, capturar planes de destino y alinear con el diseño y flujo actuales utilizando archivos Markdown y formato de tachado para contenido derogado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire et de normaliser les numéros d''étapes, de capturer les plans cibles et de s''aligner sur la conception et le flux actuels en utilisant des fichiers Markdown et un format de barrage pour le contenu obsolète.","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, Schritte zu extrahieren und zu normalisieren, Zielpläne zu erfassen und mit dem aktuellen Design und Fluss mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien und Durchstreichen-Formatierung für aufgehobenen Inhalt zu verbinden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair e normalizar números de etapas, capturar planos de destino e alinhar com o design e fluxo atuais usando arquivos Markdown e formatação de texto riscado para conteúdo ultrapassado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать и нормализовать номера шагов, захватывать целевые планы и согласовывать с текущим дизайном и потоком, используя файлы Markdown и форматирование текста с зачеркиванием для устаревшего контента.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخراج وتعتيق أرقام الخطوات واستحواذ خطط الهدف وتنسيقها مع التصميم والتيار الحاليين باستخدام ملفات Markdown وتشكيل النص المشطوب للمحتوى المتجاوز."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating step number extraction and normalization","Generating target plans from Markdown files","Debugging development workflows by identifying dependencies and prior steps"],"zh":["自动化步骤编号的提取和规范化","从 Markdown 文件生成目标计划","通过识别依赖项和先前的步骤来调试开发工作流"],"ja":["ステップ番号の抽出と正規化の自動化","Markdown ファイルからターゲットプランを生成する","依存関係と前のステップを識別して開発ワークフローをデバッグする"],"ko":["단계 번호 추출 및 표준화 자동화","Markdown 파일에서 대상 계획 생성","의존성 및 이전 단계를 식별하여 개발 워크플로우 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la extracción y normalización de números de paso","Generación de planes de destino a partir de archivos Markdown","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo mediante la identificación de dependencias y pasos anteriores"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''extraction et de la normalisation des numéros d''étapes","Génération de plans cibles à partir de fichiers Markdown","Débogage des flux de travail de développement en identifiant les dépendances et les étapes précédentes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Extraktion und Normalisierung von Schrittnummern","Erstellung von Zielplänen aus Markdown-Dateien","Fehlerbehebung bei Entwicklungsmitteln durch Identifizierung von Abhängigkeiten und vorherigen Schritten"],"pt":["Automatizar extração e normalização de números de etapas","Gerar planos de destino a partir de arquivos Markdown","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento identificando dependências e etapas anteriores"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение и нормализацию номеров шагов","Генерировать целевые планы из файлов Markdown","Отлаживать рабочие процессы разработки, определяя зависимости и предшествующие шаги"],"ar":["تحسين استخراج وتعتيق أرقام الخطوات","توليد خطط الهدف من ملفات Markdown","تصحيح أخطاء تدفقات العمل التطويرية بالتعرف على التبعيات والخطوات السابقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific Markdown files (e.g., convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","Limited to 4-digit step number normalization"],"zh":["需要访问特定的 Markdown 文件（例如 convert-progress.md、convert-architecture.md、convert-workflow.md）","仅限 4 位数字的步骤编号规范化"],"ja":["特定の Markdown ファイル（例：convert-progress.md、convert-architecture.md、convert-workflow.md）へのアクセスが必要","4 桁の数字のステップ番号正規化のみ"],"ko":["특정 Markdown 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다(예: convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","4자리 숫자 단계 번호 표준화만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos Markdown específicos (por ejemplo, convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","Limitado a la normalización de números de paso de 4 dígitos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des fichiers Markdown spécifiques (par exemple, convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","Limité à la normalisation des numéros d''étapes à 4 chiffres"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf bestimmte Markdown-Dateien (z. B. convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","Begrenzt auf die Normalisierung von 4-stelligen Schrittnummern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos Markdown específicos (por exemplo, convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","Limitado à normalização de números de etapas de 4 dígitos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к определенным файлам Markdown (например, convert-progress.md, convert-architecture.md, convert-workflow.md)","Ограничен нормализацией номеров шагов до 4 цифр"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات Markdown محددة (على سبيل المثال convert-progress.md و convert-architecture.md و convert-workflow.md)","محدود بتعتيق أرقام الخطوات الأربعة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"896d24566833e92a1725cfac47f2e1ce3f029ce723d5b7c92fe018e79160c110","qualityScore":26}');
