INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('qte77/claude-code-utils-plugin/committing-staged-with-message', 'committing-staged-with-message', 'qte77', 'claude-code-utils-plugin', 'community', 'committing-staged-with-message qte77 claude-code-utils-plugin community The committing-staged-with-message skill automates Git commits with generated messages, benefiting developers who need to track changes efficiently. It analyzes staged changes using Git commands like git diff and git log. Committing-Staged-With-Message插件提供了自动化Git提交消息的解决方案，通过分析暂存代码和最近的提交记录来生成提交消息 AIエージェントを使用したステージ済みコードのコミットメッセージ自動生成プラグイン 커밋 메시지 자동 생성을 위한 Committing-Staged-With-Message 플러그인은暂存 코드와 최근의 커밋 기록을 분석하여 제출 메시지를 생성 El plugin de Claude Code ''committing-staged-with-message'' proporciona una forma automatizada de generar mensajes de commit para cambios en etapas Le plugin Claude Code ''committing-staged-with-message'' offre une façon automatisée de générer des messages de commit pour les modifications en attente Das Claude Code-Plugin ''committing-staged-with-message'' bietet eine automatisierte Möglichkeit, Commit-Nachrichten für gestufte Änderungen zu generieren O plugin Claude Code fornece uma forma eficiente de committar alterações estágias com mensagens geradas automaticamente. Плагин Claude Code предоставляет эффективный способ коммита временных изменений с сгенерированными сообщениями. مكون إضافي Claude Code يوفر طريقة فعالة لالالتزام بالمراحل مع رسائل مُولدة تلقائيًا. how to use committing-staged-with-message what is committing-staged-with-message committing-staged-with-message alternative committing-staged-with-message vs git commit committing-staged-with-message install committing-staged-with-message setup guide git automation with committing-staged-with-message automating git commits with generated messages Git提交消息 自动化提交 AI工具 Committing-Staged-With-Message Bash工具 Size Guard Analyzes staged changes using Git commands like git diff --staged --name-only and git diff --staged --stat Generates commit messages based on diff stats summary and recent commit style Reviews detailed staged changes using git diff --staged Applies a size guard to skip full diff for large changes (>10 files or >500 lines) Utilizes Bash tool for command execution committing-staged-with-message is a Claude Code plugin that automates Git commits with generated messages based on staged changes, using commands like git diff --staged and git log --oneline.');
