INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('gordonwatts/exam-helper/github-issue-workflow', 'github-issue-workflow', 'gordonwatts', 'exam-helper', 'community', 'github-issue-workflow gordonwatts exam-helper community The github-issue-workflow skill enables developers to manage GitHub issues efficiently using the `gh` command. It streamlines the issue development flow, ensuring alignment with repository policies. Github Issue Workflow 是一个使用 gh 命令行工具来管理 Github 问题的工作流程 Github Issue Workflow は、gh コマンドラインツールを使用して Github の問題を管理するワークフローです Github Issue Workflow는 gh 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 Github 문제를 관리하는 워크플로입니다 Utiliza `gh` para descubrir y inspeccionar issues, y sigue el flujo de desarrollo de issues requerido por el repositorio Utilisez `gh` pour découvrir et inspecter les issues, puis suivez le flux de développement d''issues requis par le référentiel Verwenden Sie `gh`, um Issues zu entdecken und zu untersuchen, und folgen Sie dem erforderlichen Issue-Entwicklungsfluss des Repositorys O fluxo de trabalho de issues do Github é uma ferramenta essencial para equipes de desenvolvimento. Use o comando gh para descobrir e inspecionar issues Workflow Github Issue - это важнейший инструмент для команд разработчиков. Используйте команду gh, чтобы обнаружить и осмотреть issues с помощью ИИ Агентов Fluxo de Trabalho de Issues do Github هو أداة أساسية لفريق التطوير. استخدم الأمر gh لاكتشاف ومعاينة Issues مع أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي github-issue-workflow setup guide how to use github-issue-workflow github-issue-workflow vs github CLI github-issue-workflow install what is github-issue-workflow github-issue-workflow alternative github-issue-workflow tutorial github issue management best practices github-issue-workflow for AI agents Github Issue Workflow gh 命令行工具 Github 问题管理 issue 开发流程 CLI 命令 AIエージェント Github 工作流程 问题跟踪 版本控制 Lists open issues using `gh issue list --state open --limit 200` Views individual issues with `gh issue view <issue-number> --json number,title,body,state,labels,assignees,url` Displays issue discussions using `gh issue view <issue-number> --comments` Follows repository-required issue development flow Prefer deterministic commands for issue management Keeps work aligned to branch and PR policy github-issue-workflow is a skill that utilizes the `gh` command to discover, inspect, and manage GitHub issues, following a deterministic and policy-compliant approach.');
